.","fr":"Guide de démarrage pour docs-writer: Standards de documen...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für docs-writer: Technische Dokumen...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do docs-writer: Melhores Práticas pa...","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агента docs-writer: Руководство по Созданию ...","ar":"دليل إعداد docs-writer: أفضل الممارسات لكتابة الوثائق الفنية"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient documentation with docs-writer. Learn how to write, edit, and review docs that adhere to Gemini CLI standards. Get started now!","zh":"了解docs-writer的技术文档编写要求和标准，确保您的文档准确清晰","ja":"docs-writer AIエージェントを使用して、高品質の技術文書を制作しましょう","ko":"docs-writer를 사용하여 기술 문서를 작성하고 편집하는 방법을 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a utilizar docs-writer para crear documentación técnica precisa y clara para proyectos de desarrollo con Gemini CLI y herramientas de inteligencia ar...","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser docs-writer pour produire une documentation technique de haute qualité pour les projets de développement avec Gemini CLI et des ou...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie docs-writer verwenden können, um präzise und klare technische Dokumentationen für Entwicklungsprojekte mit Gemini CLI und KI-Tools wie ...","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o docs-writer para criar documentação técnica de alta qualidade, seguindo as melhores práticas e padrões de contribuição","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить ИИ Агент docs-writer для создания технической документации высокого качества, следуя лучшим практикам и стандартам вклада","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد docs-writer لإنشاء وثائق فنية عالية الجودة، باتباع أفضل الممارسات ومعايير المساهمة"},"definition":{"en":"docs-writer is a technical writing skill that ensures accurate and consistent documentation for the Gemini CLI project, following specific standards and contribution processes.","zh":"docs-writer是一种技术文档编写技能，用于创建准确清晰的文档内容","ja":"docs-writerは、技術文書を編集するためのAIエージェントです","ko":"docs-writer는 기술 문서를 작성하고 편집하는 데 사용되는 기술입니다","es":"Docs-writer es una habilidad de escritura de documentación técnica que sigue estrictamente los estándares de documentación proporcionados","fr":"Docs-writer est une compétence d''écriture de documentation technique qui respecte scrupuleusement les normes de documentation fournies","de":"Docs-writer ist eine Fähigkeit zur Erstellung technischer Dokumentationen, die strikt den bereitgestellten Dokumentationsstandards folgt","pt":"O docs-writer é uma habilidade de AI que cria documentação técnica de alta qualidade para projetos de desenvolvimento de software","ru":"ИИ Агент docs-writer - это навык, создающий техническую документацию высокого качества для проектов разработки программного обеспечения","ar":"docs-writer هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء وثائق فنية عالية الجودة لمشاريع تطوير البرمجيات"},"features":{"en":["Adheres to documentation standards outlined in CONTRIBUTING.md","Ensures real-time accuracy with the current Gemini CLI codebase","Follows strict contribution processes for documentation","Produces clear and consistent documentation for developers","Supports advanced metadata logic for professional formats","Enables efficient documentation review and editing"],"zh":["严格遵守文档标准","支持Gemini CLI项目","确保文档内容准确清晰","遵循CONTRIBUTING.md的贡献流程","支持多种技术文档格式"],"ja":["文書標準の厳格な遵守","Gemini CLIプロジェクトのサポート","文書内容の正確性と明瞭性の確保","CONTRIBUTING.mdの貢献プロセスの遵守","多様な技術文書形式のサポート"],"ko":["문서 표준의 엄격한 준수","Gemini CLI 프로젝트 지원","문서 내용의 정확성과 명확성의 보장","CONTRIBUTING.md의 기여 프로세스 준수","다양한 기술 문서 형식 지원"],"es":["Seguimiento de carpetas en tiempo real","Lógica de metadatos avanzada","Soporte para formatos profesionales","Integración con Gemini CLI","Estándares de documentación estrictos","Proceso de contribución definido en CONTRIBUTING.md"],"fr":["Suivi de dossiers en temps réel","Logique de métadonnées avancée","Prise en charge de formats professionnels","Intégration avec Gemini CLI","Normes de documentation strictes","Processus de contribution défini dans CONTRIBUTING.md"],"de":["Ordnerüberwachung in Echtzeit","Erweiterte Metadatenlogik","Unterstützung für professionelle Formate","Integration mit Gemini CLI","Strenge Dokumentationsstandards","Beitrittsprozess in CONTRIBUTING.md definiert"],"pt":["Seguimento de padrões de contribuição estritos","Criação de documentação técnica de alta qualidade","Suporte à edição e revisão de documentação","Integração com o projeto Gemini CLI","Uso de tecnologias de documentação avançadas"],"ru":["Следование строгим стандартам вклада","Создание технической документации высокого качества","Поддержка редактирования и проверки документации","Интеграция с проектом Gemini CLI","Использование передовых технологий документации"],"ar":["التزام بمعايير المساهمة الصارمة","إنشاء وثائق فنية عالية الجودة","دعم تحرير ومراجعة الوثائق","التكامل مع مشروع Gemini CLI","استخدام تقنيات وثائق متقدمة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use docs-writer","what is docs-writer","docs-writer alternative","docs-writer vs Gemini CLI","docs-writer install guide","docs-writer setup for AI agents","technical writing for Gemini CLI","docs-writer contribution process","Gemini CLI documentation standards"],"zh":["docs-writer","技术文档编写","文档标准","Gemini CLI","CONTRIBUTING.md","技术文档格式","AIエージェント","技术文书编辑"],"ja":["docs-writer","AIエージェント","技術文書編集","文書標準","Gemini CLI","CONTRIBUTING.md","技術文書形式","技術文書作成"],"ko":["docs-writer","기술 문서 작성","문서 표준","Gemini CLI","CONTRIBUTING.md","기술 문서 형식","AI 에이전트","기술 문서 편집"],"es":["docs-writer","documentación técnica","Gemini CLI","Agentes de IA","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","estándares de documentación","proceso de contribución","escritura de documentación","documentación de proyectos"],"fr":["docs-writer","documentation technique","Gemini CLI","Agents d''IA","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","normes de documentation","processus de contribution","écriture de documentation","documentation de projets"],"de":["docs-writer","technische Dokumentation","Gemini CLI","KI-Agents","KI-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","Dokumentationsstandards","Beitrittsprozess","Dokumentation schreiben","Projekt-Dokumentation"],"pt":["docs-writer","documentação técnica","Gemini CLI","contribuição de código","padrões de documentação","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de documentação","AI para documentação"],"ru":["ИИ Агент docs-writer","техническая документация","Gemini CLI","вклад в код","стандарты документации","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты документации","ИИ для документации"],"ar":["docs-writer","وثائق فنية","Gemini CLI","مساهمة في الكود","معايير وثائق","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات وثائق","الذكاء الاصطناعي للوثائق"]}},"owner":"marcusagm","repo":"Mundam","repoPath":"marcusagm/Mundam","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.293Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-writer","description":"","bodyPreview":"# `docs-writer` skill instructions\n\nAs an expert technical writer and editor for the Gemini CLI project, you produce\naccurate, clear, and consistent documentation. When asked to write, edit, or\nreview documentation, you must ensure the content strictly adheres to the\nprovided documentation standards and accurately reflects the current codebase.\nAdhere to the contribution process in `CONTRIBUTING.md` and the following\nproject standards.\n\n## Phase 1: Documentation standards\n\nAdhering to these prin","body":"# `docs-writer` skill instructions\n\nAs an expert technical writer and editor for the Gemini CLI project, you produce\naccurate, clear, and consistent documentation. When asked to write, edit, or\nreview documentation, you must ensure the content strictly adheres to the\nprovided documentation standards and accurately reflects the current codebase.\nAdhere to the contribution process in `CONTRIBUTING.md` and the following\nproject standards.\n\n## Phase 1: Documentation standards\n\nAdhering to these principles and standards when writing, editing, and reviewing.\n\n### Voice and tone\nAdopt a tone that balances professionalism with a helpful, conversational\napproach.\n\n- **Perspective and tense:** Address the reader as \"you.\" Use active voice and\n  present tense (e.g., \"The API returns...\").\n- **Tone:** Professional, friendly, and direct. \n- **Clarity:** Use simple vocabulary. Avoid jargon, slang, and marketing hype.\n- **Global Audience:** Write in standard US English. Avoid idioms and cultural\n  references.\n- **Requirements:** Be clear about requirements (\"must\") vs. recommendations\n  (\"we recommend\"). Avoid \"should.\"\n- **Word Choice:** Avoid \"please\" and anthropomorphism (e.g., \"the server\n  thinks\"). Use contractions (don''t, it''s).\n\n### Language and grammar\nWrite precisely to ensure your instructions are unambiguous.\n\n- **Abbreviations:** Avoid Latin abbreviations; use \"for example\" (not \"e.g.\")\n  and \"that is\" (not \"i.e.\").\n- **Punctuation:** Use the serial comma. Place periods and commas inside\n  quotation marks.\n- **Dates:** Use unambiguous formats (e.g., \"January 22, 2026\").\n- **Conciseness:** Use \"lets you\" instead of \"allows you to.\" Use precise,\n  specific verbs.\n- **Examples:** Use meaningful names in examples; avoid placeholders like\n  \"foo\" or \"bar.\"\n\n### Formatting and syntax\nApply consistent formatting to make documentation visually organized and\naccessible.\n\n- **Overview paragraphs:** Every heading must be followed by at least one\n  introductory overview paragraph before any lists or sub-headings.\n- **Text wrap:** Wrap text at 80 characters (except long links or tables).\n- **Casing:** Use sentence case for headings, titles, and bolded text.\n- **Naming:** Always refer to the project as `Gemini CLI` (never\n  `the Gemini CLI`).\n- **Lists:** Use numbered lists for sequential steps and bulleted lists\n  otherwise. Keep list items parallel in structure.\n- **UI and code:** Use **bold** for UI elements and `code font` for filenames,\n  snippets, commands, and API elements. Focus on the task when discussing\n  interaction.\n- **Links:** Use descriptive anchor text; avoid \"click here.\" Ensure the link\n  makes sense out of context.\n- **Accessibility:** Use semantic HTML elements correctly (headings, lists, \n  tables).\n- **Media:** Use lowercase hyphenated filenames. Provide descriptive alt text\n  for all images.\n\n### Structure\n- **BLUF:** Start with an introduction explaining what to expect.\n- **Experimental features:** If a feature is clearly noted as experimental,\nadd the following note immediately after the introductory paragraph:\n  `> **Note:** This is a preview feature currently under active development.`\n- **Headings:** Use hierarchical headings to support the user journey.\n- **Procedures:** \n  - Introduce lists of steps with a complete sentence.\n  - Start each step with an imperative verb.\n  - Number sequential steps; use bullets for non-sequential lists.\n  - Put conditions before instructions (e.g., \"On the Settings page, click...\").\n  - Provide clear context for where the action takes place.\n  - Indicate optional steps clearly (e.g., \"Optional: ...\").\n- **Elements:** Use bullet lists, tables, notes (`> **Note:**`), and warnings \n  (`> **Warning:**`).\n- **Avoid using a table of contents:** If a table of contents is present, remove\n  it.\n- **Next steps:** Conclude with a \"Next steps\" section if applicable.\n\n## Phase 2: Preparation\nBefore modifying any documentation, thoroughly investigate the request and the\nsurrounding context. \n\n1.  **Clarify:** Understand the core request. Differentiate between writing new\n    content and editing existing content. If the request is ambiguous (e.g.,\n    \"fix the docs\"), ask for clarification.\n2.  **Investigate:** Examine relevant code (primarily in `packages/`) for\n    accuracy.\n3.  **Audit:** Read the latest versions of relevant files in `docs/`.\n4.  **Connect:** Identify all referencing pages if changing behavior. Check if\n    `docs/sidebar.json` needs updates.\n5.  **Plan:** Create a step-by-step plan before making changes.\n\n## Phase 3: Execution\nImplement your plan by either updating existing files or creating new ones\nusing the appropriate file system tools. Use `replace` for small edits and\n`write_file` for new files or large rewrites.\n\n### Editing existing documentation\nFollow these additional steps when asked to review or update existing\ndocumentation.\n\n- **Gaps:** Identify areas where the documentation is incomplete or no longer\n  reflects existing code.\n- **Structure:** Apply \"Structure (New Docs)\" rules (BLUF, headings, etc.) when \n  adding new sections to existing pages.\n- **Tone:** Ensure the tone is active and engaging. Use \"you\" and contractions.\n- **Clarity:** Correct awkward wording, spelling, and grammar. Rephrase\n  sentences to make them easier for users to understand.\n- **Consistency:** Check for consistent terminology and style across all edited\n  documents.\n\n\n## Phase 4: Verification and finalization\nPerform a final quality check to ensure that all changes are correctly formatted\nand that all links are functional.\n\n1.  **Accuracy:** Ensure content accurately reflects the implementation and\n  technical behavior.\n2.  **Self-review:** Re-read changes for formatting, correctness, and flow.\n3.  **Link check:** Verify all new and existing links leading to or from modified\n    pages.\n4.  **Format:** Once all changes are complete, ask to execute `npm run format`\n    to ensure consistent formatting across the project. If the user confirms,\n    execute the command.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T15:24:06.095Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Technical Documentation Agents maintaining strict standards compliance in CLI tool documentation.","zh":"对于维护CLI工具文档严格标准合规性的技术文档AI代理至关重要。","ja":"CLIツールのドキュメントにおいて厳格な標準コンプライアンスを維持する技術文書エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"CLI 도구 문서의 엄격한 표준 준수를 유지하는 기술 문서 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Documentación Técnica que mantienen un estricto cumplimiento de estándares en la documentación de herramientas CLI.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Documentation Technique maintenant une conformité stricte aux normes dans la documentation d''outils CLI.","de":"Essenziell für Technische Dokumentations-Agents, die die strikte Einhaltung von Standards in der CLI-Werkzeugdokumentation aufrechterhalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Documentação Técnica que mantêm a conformidade com padrões rigorosos na documentação de ferramentas CLI.","ru":"Необходим для Агентов Технической Документации, обеспечивающих строгое соответствие стандартам в документации CLI инструментов.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء التوثيق الفني الذين يحافظون على الامتثال لمعايير صارمة في توثيق أدوات واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces adherence to Gemini CLI documentation standards and ensures content accurately reflects the current codebase. Provides structured content analysis and maintains consistency across technical documentation.","zh":"强制遵守Gemini CLI文档标准，并确保内容准确反映当前代码库。提供结构化的内容分析并维护技术文档的一致性。","ja":"Gemini CLIドキュメント標準への準拠を強制し、コンテンツが現在のコードベースを正確に反映することを保証します。構造化されたコンテンツ分析を提供し、技術文書全体の一貫性を維持します。","ko":"Gemini CLI 문서 표준을 준수하도록 강제하고 콘텐츠가 현재 코드베이스를 정확하게 반영하도록 보장합니다. 구조화된 콘텐츠 분석을 제공하고 기술 문서 전반에 걸쳐 일관성을 유지합니다.","es":"Impone la adhesión a los estándares de documentación de Gemini CLI y garantiza que el contenido refleje con precisión el codebase actual. Proporciona análisis de contenido estructurado y mantiene la coherencia en toda la documentación técnica.","fr":"Applique le respect des normes de documentation Gemini CLI et garantit que le contenu reflète avec précision le codebase actuel. Fournit une analyse de contenu structurée et maintient la cohérence dans toute la documentation technique.","de":"Erzwingt die Einhaltung der Gemini CLI-Dokumentationsstandards und stellt sicher, dass der Inhalt den aktuellen Codebase genau widerspiegelt. Bietet strukturierte Inhaltsanalyse und gewährleistet Konsistenz in der gesamten technischen Dokumentation.","pt":"Impõe a adesão aos padrões de documentação do Gemini CLI e garante que o conteúdo reflita com precisão a base de código atual. Fornece análise de conteúdo estruturada e mantém a consistência em toda a documentação técnica.","ru":"Обеспечивает соблюдение стандартов документации Gemini CLI и гарантирует, что контент точно отражает текущую кодовую базу. Обеспечивает структурированный анализ контента и поддерживает согласованность всей технической документации.","ar":"يفرض الالتزام بمعايير توثيق Gemini CLI ويضمن أن المحتوى يعكس بدقة قاعدة الكود الحالية. يوفر تحليل محتوى منظم ويحافظ على الاتساق عبر التوثيق الفني."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating accurate CLI command documentation","Maintaining documentation-codebase synchronization","Enforcing project-specific documentation standards","Producing technical content adhering to CONTRIBUTING.md processes"],"zh":["生成准确的CLI命令文档","维护文档与代码库的同步","强制执行项目特定的文档标准","生成遵循CONTRIBUTING.md流程的技术内容"],"ja":["正確なCLIコマンドドキュメントの生成","ドキュメントとコードベースの同期維持","プロジェクト固有のドキュメント標準の強制","CONTRIBUTING.mdプロセスに準拠した技術コンテンツの作成"],"ko":["정확한 CLI 명령 문서 생성","문서-코드베이스 동기화 유지","프로젝트별 문서 표준 적용 강제","CONTRIBUTING.md 프로세스를 준수하는 기술 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Generar documentación precisa de comandos CLI","Mantener la sincronización entre la documentación y el codebase","Hacer cumplir estándares de documentación específicos del proyecto","Producir contenido técnico que se adhiera a los procesos de CONTRIBUTING.md"],"fr":["Générer une documentation précise des commandes CLI","Maintenir la synchronisation documentation-codebase","Appliquer des normes de documentation spécifiques au projet","Produire du contenu technique respectant les processus CONTRIBUTING.md"],"de":["Erstellen einer genauen CLI-Befehlsdokumentation","Aufrechterhalten der Dokumentation-Codebase-Synchronisation","Durchsetzung projektspezifischer Dokumentationsstandards","Erstellen von technischen Inhalten, die den CONTRIBUTING.md-Prozessen entsprechen"],"pt":["Gerar documentação precisa de comandos CLI","Manter a sincronização entre documentação e base de código","Impor padrões de documentação específicos do projeto","Produzir conteúdo técnico em conformidade com os processos do CONTRIBUTING.md"],"ru":["Генерация точной документации по CLI командам","Поддержание синхронизации документации и кодовой базы","Обеспечение соблюдения стандартов документации, специфичных для проекта","Создание технического контента в соответствии с процессами CONTRIBUTING.md"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق دقيق لأوامر واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)","الحفاظ على مزامنة التوثيق مع قاعدة الكود","فرض معايير التوثيق الخاصة بالمشروع","إنتاج محتوى فني يلتزم بإجراءات ملف CONTRIBUTING.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Gemini CLI project-specific only","Requires access to current codebase","Must adhere to strict documentation standards"],"zh":["仅限特定的Gemini CLI项目","需要访问当前代码库","必须遵守严格的文档标准"],"ja":["Gemini CLIプロジェクト固有のみ","現在のコードベースへのアクセスが必要","厳格なドキュメント標準に準拠する必要がある"],"ko":["Gemini CLI 프로젝트 전용","현재 코드베이스에 대한 액세스 필요","엄격한 문서 표준을 준수해야 함"],"es":["Específico solo para el proyecto Gemini CLI","Requiere acceso al codebase actual","Debe adherirse a estrictos estándares de documentación"],"fr":["Spécifique au projet Gemini CLI uniquement","Nécessite un accès au codebase actuel","Doit respecter des normes de documentation strictes"],"de":["Nur für das spezifische Gemini CLI-Projekt","Erfordert Zugriff auf den aktuellen Codebase","Muss strenge Dokumentationsstandards einhalten"],"pt":["Específico apenas para o projeto Gemini CLI","Requer acesso à base de código atual","Deve aderir a padrões de documentação rigorosos"],"ru":["Только для конкретного проекта Gemini CLI","Требует доступ к текущей кодовой базе","Должен соответствовать строгим стандартам документации"],"ar":["مخصص لمشروع Gemini CLI فقط","يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الكود الحالية","يجب الالتزام بمعايير توثيق صارمة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e5681c266521a14ac43964a3fc65cc93639d897a305c74c765fac86729120c94","qualityScore":35}');
