INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('marcusagm/Mundam/docs-writer', 'docs-writer', 'marcusagm', 'Mundam', 'community', 'docs-writer marcusagm Mundam community The docs-writer skill enables technical writers to produce accurate documentation for the Gemini CLI project, adhering to strict standards and reflecting the current codebase. It benefits developers and technical writers working on the project. docs-writer是一种技术文档编写技能，需要准确清晰的文档内容，严格遵守文档标准 docs-writerは、Gemini CLIプロジェクトの技術文書を編集するためのスキルです docs-writer는 기술 문서를 작성하고 편집하는 데 사용되는 기술입니다 Docs-writer es una habilidad para crear documentación técnica precisa y clara para proyectos de desarrollo con Gemini CLI. Docs-writer est une compétence pour produire une documentation technique de haute qualité pour les projets de développement avec Gemini CLI. Docs-writer ist eine Fähigkeit zur Erstellung präziser und klarer technischer Dokumentationen für Entwicklungsprojekte mit Gemini CLI. O docs-writer é uma habilidade de escrita e edição de documentação técnica para o projeto Gemini CLI, que segue padrões estritos de contribuição e documentação ИИ Агент docs-writer - это навык написания и редактирования технической документации для проекта Gemini CLI, который следует строгим стандартам вклада и документации docs-writer هو مهارة كتابة وتنسيق وثائق فنية لمشروع Gemini CLI، والذي يتبع معايير مساهمة ووثائق صارمة how to use docs-writer what is docs-writer docs-writer alternative docs-writer vs Gemini CLI docs-writer install guide docs-writer setup for AI agents technical writing for Gemini CLI docs-writer contribution process Gemini CLI documentation standards docs-writer 技术文档编写 文档标准 Gemini CLI CONTRIBUTING.md 技术文档格式 AIエージェント 技术文书编辑 Adheres to documentation standards outlined in CONTRIBUTING.md Ensures real-time accuracy with the current Gemini CLI codebase Follows strict contribution processes for documentation Produces clear and consistent documentation for developers Supports advanced metadata logic for professional formats Enables efficient documentation review and editing docs-writer is a technical writing skill that ensures accurate and consistent documentation for the Gemini CLI project, following specific standards and contribution processes.');
