ile architecture with steps in steps-v/ directory Configuration loading from _bmad/bmm/config.yaml Reviews existing PRDs against BMAD standards through comprehensive quality assessment Triggers the BMAD PRD Validation workflow for automated validation bmad-validate-prd is a skill that activates the BMAD PRD Validation workflow, using a step-file architecture and configuration loading from _bmad/bmm/config.yaml');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rustyrazorblade/easy-db-lab/openspec-consolidate-specs', 'community', 'rustyrazorblade', 'easy-db-lab', 'rustyrazorblade/easy-db-lab', 'openspec-consolidate-specs', 32, 9, 34, '2026-03-06T20:27:31Z', '2026-03-07T01:51:15.223Z', '4de4ae99bd2aec9759aff13e3ef694ed03fd1e28032b684cd08942e0d0207f41', '{"id":"rustyrazorblade/easy-db-lab/openspec-consolidate-specs","name":"openspec-consolidate-specs","description":{"en":"The openspec-consolidate-specs skill helps developers review OpenSpec specs for overlapping functionality and propose consolidation, streamlining database testing in AWS for Cassandra users.","zh":"openspec-consolidate-specs Skill 用于创建 AWS 数据库测试环境，通过优化 OpenSpec 规范以减少冗余","ja":"openspec-consolidate-specs スキルは、AWS データベーステスト環境を作成し、OpenSpec 規格を最適化して冗長性を減らすために使用されます","ko":"openspec-consolidate-specs Skill은 AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경을 생성하고 OpenSpec 규격을 최적화하여 중복을 줄이는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La consolidación de especificaciones OpenSpec permite eliminar la funcionalidad sobrepuesta y mejorar la eficiencia en entornos de prueba de bases de datos en AWS con Cassandra","fr":"La consolidation des spécifications OpenSpec permet d''éliminer les fonctionnalités redondantes et d''améliorer l''efficacité dans les environnements de test de bases de données sur AWS avec Cassandra","de":"Die Konsolidierung von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen ermöglicht die Entfernung überlappender Funktionalitäten und die Verbesserung der Effizienz in Testumgebungen für Datenbanken in AWS mit Cassandra","pt":"O openspec-consolidate-specs é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar ambientes de teste de banco de dados na AWS, permitindo a automação de processos de teste e a otimização de specs","ru":"openspec-consolidate-specs - это инструмент, который помогает создавать лабораторные среды тестирования баз данных в AWS, автоматизируя тестовые процессы и оптимизируя specs","ar":"openspec-consolidate-specs هو أداة تساعد في إنشاء بيئات مختبرية لاختبار قواعد البيانات في AWS، مما يسمح بتحسين عمليات الاختبار وتحسين المواصفات"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"openspec-consolidate-specs: Consolidation Setup Guide | A...","zh":"openspec-consolidate-specs Setup Guide: AWS 数据库测试环境创建","ja":"openspec-consolidate-specs のベストプラクティス: AIエージェントによる AWS デー...","ko":"openspec-consolidate-specs 설정 가이드: AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경 생성","es":"Guía de consolidación de especificaciones OpenSpec","fr":"Guide de consolidation des spécifications OpenSpec","de":"Leitfaden zur Konsolidierung von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen","pt":"Guia de Configuração do openspec-consolidate-specs para A...","ru":"Настройка openspec-consolidate-specs для создания лаборат...","ar":"دليل إعداد openspec-consolidate-specs لإنشاء بيئات مختبري..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how openspec-consolidate-specs simplifies spec management. Learn to trigger consolidation after archiving changes or noticing overlap in specs.","zh":"使用 openspec-consolidate-specs Skill 创建 AWS 数据库测试环境，优化 OpenSpec 规范以减少冗余","ja":"openspec-consolidate-specs スキルを使用して AWS データベーステスト環境を作成し、OpenSpec 規格を最適化して冗長性を減らす","ko":"openspec-consolidate-specs Skill을 사용하여 AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경을 생성하고 OpenSpec 규격을 최적화하여 중복을 줄입니다","es":"Aprende a consolidar especificaciones OpenSpec para eliminar la funcionalidad sobrepuesta y mejorar la eficiencia en AWS con Cassandra","fr":"Découvrez comment consolider les spécifications OpenSpec pour éliminer les fonctionnalités redondantes et améliorer l''efficacité sur AWS avec Cassandra","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie OpenSpec-Spezifikationen konsolidieren, um überlappende Funktionalitäten zu entfernen und die Effizienz in AWS mit Cassandra zu verbessern","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o openspec-consolidate-specs para criar ambientes de teste de banco de dados na AWS e otimize seus processos de teste com ferramentas de...","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить openspec-consolidate-specs для создания лабораторных сред тестирования баз данных в AWS и автоматизировать ваши тестовые процессы с по...","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد openspec-consolidate-specs لإنشاء بيئات مختبرية لاختبار قواعد البيانات في AWS وتحسين عمليات اختبارك مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"openspec-consolidate-specs is a skill that automates the review of OpenSpec specs to identify overlapping functionality and suggest consolidation.","zh":"openspec-consolidate-specs 是一种 Skill，用于创建 AWS 数据库测试环境并优化 OpenSpec 规范","ja":"openspec-consolidate-specs は、AWS データベーステスト環境を作成し、OpenSpec 規格を最適化するためのスキルです","ko":"openspec-consolidate-specs는 AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경을 생성하고 OpenSpec 규격을 최적화하는 Skill입니다","es":"La consolidación de especificaciones OpenSpec es un proceso para eliminar la funcionalidad sobrepuesta en entornos de prueba de bases de datos","fr":"La consolidation des spécifications OpenSpec est un processus pour éliminer les fonctionnalités redondantes dans les environnements de test de bases de données","de":"Die Konsolidierung von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen ist ein Prozess zur Entfernung überlappender Funktionalitäten in Testumgebungen für Datenbanken","pt":"O openspec-consolidate-specs é uma ferramenta de automação que consolida specs de teste de banco de dados","ru":"openspec-consolidate-specs - это инструмент автоматизации, который консолидирует specs тестирования баз данных","ar":"openspec-consolidate-specs هو أداة تحكم آلي تقوم بتوحيد مواصفات اختبار قواعد البيانات"},"features":{"en":["Reads all specs under openspec/specs/ directory","Uses parallel subagents to read specs in batches grouped by domain","Triggers consolidation after archiving changes or noticing overlap","Supports review of specs for overlapping functionality","Proposes consolidation of specs for efficient management","Streamlines database testing in AWS for Cassandra"],"zh":["创建 AWS 数据库测试环境","优化 OpenSpec 规范以减少冗余","支持 Cassandra 数据库","使用并行子代理读取规范","自动检测规范重叠"],"ja":["AWS データベーステスト環境の作成","OpenSpec 規格の最適化による冗長性の減少","Cassandra データベースのサポート","並列サブエージェントによる規格の読み取り","規格の重複の自動検出"],"ko":["AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경 생성","OpenSpec 규격 최적화로 중복 제거","Cassandra 데이터베이스 지원","병렬 서브 에이전트를 통한 규격 읽기","규격 중복 자동 감지"],"es":["Lectura de especificaciones OpenSpec en paralelo","Detección de funcionalidad sobrepuesta en entornos de prueba de bases de datos","Consolidación de especificaciones para mejorar la eficiencia en AWS","Compatibilidad con Cassandra","Uso de subagentes para leer especificaciones en batches"],"fr":["Lecture de spécifications OpenSpec en parallèle","Détection de fonctionnalités redondantes dans les environnements de test de bases de données","Consolidation de spécifications pour améliorer l''efficacité sur AWS","Compatibilité avec Cassandra","Utilisation de sous-agents pour lire les spécifications en batches"],"de":["Parallelles Lesen von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen","Erkennung überlappender Funktionalitäten in Testumgebungen für Datenbanken","Konsolidierung von Spezifikationen zur Verbesserung der Effizienz in AWS","Kompatibilität mit Cassandra","Verwendung von Subagenten zum Lesen von Spezifikationen in Batches"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes de teste de banco de dados na AWS","Consolidação de specs de teste de banco de dados","Automatização de processos de teste com parallel subagents","Leitura de specs em batches agrupados por domínio","Otimização de specs para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Создание лабораторных сред тестирования баз данных в AWS","Консолидация specs тестирования баз данных","Автоматизация тестовых процессов с помощью параллельных субагентов","Чтение specs в пакетах, сгруппированных по домену","Оптимизация specs для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات مختبرية لاختبار قواعد البيانات في AWS","توحيد مواصفات اختبار قواعد البيانات","تحسين عمليات الاختبار مع وكلاء فرعي متوازي","قراءة المواصفات في حزم مجمعة حسب المجال","تحسين المواصفات لأداء أفضل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use openspec-consolidate-specs","openspec-consolidate-specs setup guide","what is openspec-consolidate-specs","openspec-consolidate-specs alternative","openspec-consolidate-specs vs spec management tools","openspec-consolidate-specs install","cassandra database testing","aws database testing tools","openspec specs consolidation"],"zh":["openspec-consolidate-specs","AWS 数据库测试环境","OpenSpec 规范","Cassandra 数据库","AI 代理","数据库测试","环境创建"],"ja":["openspec-consolidate-specs","AWS データベーステスト環境","OpenSpec 規格","Cassandra データベース","AIエージェント","データベーステスト","環境作成"],"ko":["openspec-consolidate-specs","AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경","OpenSpec 규격","Cassandra 데이터베이스","AI 에이전트","데이터베이스 테스트","환경 생성"],"es":["consolidación de especificaciones OpenSpec","eliminación de funcionalidad sobrepuesta","eficiencia en AWS","Cassandra","entornos de prueba de bases de datos","herramientas de automatización","Agentes de inteligencia artificial","Herramientas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["consolidation des spécifications OpenSpec","élimination de fonctionnalités redondantes","efficacité sur AWS","Cassandra","environnements de test de bases de données","outils d''automatisation","Agents d''intelligence artificielle","Outils de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Konsolidierung von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen","Entfernung überlappender Funktionalitäten","Effizienz in AWS","Cassandra","Testumgebungen für Datenbanken","Automatisierungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz Agenten","Software-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["openspec-consolidate-specs","teste de banco de dados","ambientes de teste na AWS","automação de processos de teste","consolidação de specs","parallel subagents","leitura de specs em batches"],"ru":["openspec-consolidate-specs","тестирование баз данных","лабораторные среды тестирования в AWS","автоматизация тестовых процессов","консолидация specs","параллельные субагенты","чтение specs в пакетах"],"ar":["openspec-consolidate-specs","اختبار قواعد البيانات","بيئات مختبرية لاختبار قواعد البيانات في AWS","تحسين عمليات الاختبار","توحيد مواصفات اختبار","وكلاء فرعي متوازي","قراءة المواصفات في حزم"]}},"owner":"rustyrazorblade","repo":"easy-db-lab","repoPath":"rustyrazorblade/easy-db-lab","stars":32,"forks":9,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T20:27:31Z","topics":["cassandra"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-consolidate-specs","description":"Use when archiving an OpenSpec change that adds or modifies specs, or when the user asks to review specs for overlap. Finds specs that describe the same system from different angles and proposes merging them under a more general name.","bodyPreview":"Review OpenSpec specs for overlapping functionality and propose consolidation.\n\n**When to trigger:**\n- After archiving a change that added or modified specs\n- When the user explicitly asks to review specs for overlap\n- When you notice during exploration that multiple specs cover the same system\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Read all specs**\n\n   List directories under `openspec/specs/` and read each `spec.md`. Use parallel subagents to read specs in batches grouped by domain (observability, cluster infrastruc","body":"Review OpenSpec specs for overlapping functionality and propose consolidation.\n\n**When to trigger:**\n- After archiving a change that added or modified specs\n- When the user explicitly asks to review specs for overlap\n- When you notice during exploration that multiple specs cover the same system\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Read all specs**\n\n   List directories under `openspec/specs/` and read each `spec.md`. Use parallel subagents to read specs in batches grouped by domain (observability, cluster infrastructure, databases, etc.).\n\n   For each spec, note: scope, key requirements, technologies/components, file paths and port numbers mentioned.\n\n2. **Identify overlap candidates**\n\n   Look for specs that:\n   - Describe the **same system from different angles** (e.g., installation vs. runtime behavior vs. configuration)\n   - Cover **producer and consumer** of the same data flow (e.g., one spec generates logs, another collects them)\n   - Are a **strict subset** of a broader spec (e.g., detailed spec for one section of a parent spec)\n   - Share the same **file paths, ports, or component names**\n\n3. **Propose merges (max 3 candidates)**\n\n   For each candidate, present:\n   - Which specs to merge and why they overlap\n   - A proposed new name (use a broader, more descriptive term)\n   - What the merged structure would look like (requirement sections)\n   - Whether any content would be lost or needs careful reconciliation\n   - Any **conflicts** between the specs (inconsistent paths, ports, or behaviors)\n\n   Let the user pick which (if any) to proceed with.\n\n4. **Execute merge (when approved)**\n\n   - Create the new spec directory under `openspec/specs/<new-name>/`\n   - Write the merged `spec.md` preserving all scenarios from both sources\n   - Unify terminology and remove duplication (e.g., if both specs describe the same installation step, keep one)\n   - If the old specs used different approaches (e.g., file-based logs vs journald), use the newer/correct approach\n   - Remove old spec directories\n   - Check for references to old spec names in `openspec/changes/` and note them (archived changes don''t need updating, but active changes do)\n\n**Naming guidelines:**\n- Prefer names that describe the **capability** not the **component** (e.g., `tool-execution` not `exec-logging`)\n- Prefer names that cover the **full scope** of the merged spec (e.g., `emr-node-observability` not `spark-node-otel-collector`)\n- Use kebab-case\n\n**Guardrails:**\n- Never merge specs that cover genuinely different systems just because they share a technology\n- Always check for conflicts before merging — inconsistent details need resolution, not silent dropping\n- Present candidates to the user before executing any merge\n- Preserve all scenarios from source specs — merging reduces files, not coverage\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:51:15.223Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents focused on DevOps and Database Management needing to streamline OpenSpec specs review and consolidation for Cassandra users in AWS.","zh":"非常适合专注于DevOps和数据库管理的AI代理，需要简化OpenSpec规格审查和合并，用于AWS中的Cassandra用户。","ja":"DevOpsとデータベース管理に焦点を当てたAIエージェントに最適で、AWSのCassandraユーザー向けのOpenSpec仕様のレビューと統合をストリームライン化する必要があります。","ko":"DevOps 및 데이터베이스 관리에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 AWS의 Cassandra 사용자를 위해 OpenSpec 사양 검토 및 통합을 간소화해야 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en DevOps y gestión de bases de datos que necesitan simplificar la revisión y consolidación de las especificaciones de OpenSpec para usuarios de Cassandra en AWS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur DevOps et la gestion de bases de données ayant besoin de rationaliser l''examen et la consolidation des spécifications OpenSpec pour les utilisateurs de Cassandra sur AWS.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf DevOps und Datenbankverwaltung ausgerichtet sind und die Überprüfung und Konsolidierung von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen für Cassandra-Benutzer in AWS rationalisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em DevOps e Gerenciamento de Banco de Dados que precisam otimizar a revisão e consolidação de especificações OpenSpec para usuários do Cassandra na AWS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на DevOps и управление базами данных, которым необходимо оптимизировать просмотр и объединение спецификаций OpenSpec для пользователей Cassandra в AWS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على DevOps وإدارة قواعد البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى تسهيل مراجعة ومصادر مواصفات OpenSpec لمستخدمي Cassandra في AWS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review OpenSpec specs for overlapping functionality, propose consolidation, and optimize database testing in AWS using Cassandra, leveraging parallel subagents for efficient spec analysis across domains like observability and cluster infrastructure.","zh":"赋予代理审查OpenSpec规格以查找重叠功能、提出合并建议，并使用Cassandra在AWS中优化数据库测试，利用并行子代理高效地分析诸如可观察性和集群基础设施等领域的规格。","ja":"エージェントにOpenSpec仕様をレビューして重複する機能を特定し、統合を提案し、Cassandraを使用してAWSでのデータベーステストを最適化する力を与え、並列サブエージェントを使用して可観測性やクラスタインフラストラクチャなどのドメインの仕様を効率的に分析します。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenSpec 사양을 검토하여 중복 기능을 식별하고 통합을 제안하며 Cassandra를 사용하여 AWS에서 데이터베이스 테스트를 최적화하는 기능을 제공하고 병렬 하위 에이전트를 사용하여 관찰 가능성 및 클러스터 인프라와 같은 도메인의 사양을 효율적으로 분석합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar las especificaciones de OpenSpec para la funcionalidad superpuesta, proponer la consolidación y optimizar las pruebas de base de datos en AWS utilizando Cassandra, aprovechando subagentes paralelos para un análisis de especificaciones eficiente en dominios como la observabilidad y la infraestructura de clúster.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''examiner les spécifications OpenSpec pour la fonctionnalité chevauchante, de proposer une consolidation et d''optimiser les tests de base de données sur AWS en utilisant Cassandra, en exploitant des sous-agents parallèles pour une analyse efficace des spécifications dans des domaines tels que l''observabilité et l''infrastructure de cluster.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, OpenSpec-Spezifikationen für überlappende Funktionalitäten zu überprüfen, Konsolidierung vorzuschlagen und Datenbanktests in AWS mit Cassandra zu optimieren, indem sie parallele Subagents für eine effiziente Spezifikationsanalyse in Bereichen wie Beobachtbarkeit und Cluster-Infrastruktur nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisarem as especificações OpenSpec para funcionalidades sobrepostas, proporem consolidação e otimizem os testes de banco de dados na AWS usando Cassandra, aproveitando subagentes paralelos para uma análise eficiente de especificações em domínios como observabilidade e infraestrutura de cluster.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью просматривать спецификации OpenSpec для функциональности, перекрывающейся, предлагать объединение и оптимизировать тестирование баз данных в AWS с использованием Cassandra, используя параллельных субагентов для эффективного анализа спецификаций в таких областях, как наблюдаемость и инфраструктура кластера.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء مراجعة مواصفات OpenSpec للوظائف المتراكبة، واقتراح التوحيد، وتحسين اختبارات قاعدة البيانات في AWS باستخدام Cassandra، مستفيدة من الوكلاء الفرعيين المتوازية للتحليل الفعال لمواصفات عبر المجالات مثل المراقبة وبنية تحتية للعنقود."},"useCases":{"en":["Consolidating redundant specs after archiving changes","Automating spec overlap detection during exploration","Streamlining database testing for Cassandra users in AWS"],"zh":["合并更改后冗余的规格","在探索过程中自动检测规格重叠","为AWS中的Cassandra用户简化数据库测试"],"ja":["変更をアーカイブした後、冗長な仕様を統合する","探索中に仕様の重複を自動的に検出する","AWSのCassandraユーザー向けのデータベーステストを簡素化する"],"ko":["변경 사항을 아카이브한 후冗余 사양을 통합","탐색 중에 사양 중복을 자동으로 검색","AWS의 Cassandra 사용자를 위한 데이터베이스 테스트를 간소화"],"es":["Consolidación de especificaciones redundantes después de archivar cambios","Automatización de la detección de superposición de especificaciones durante la exploración","Optimización de las pruebas de base de datos para usuarios de Cassandra en AWS"],"fr":["Consolidation de spécifications redondantes après archivage des modifications","Automatisation de la détection de chevauchement de spécifications pendant l''exploration","Optimisation des tests de base de données pour les utilisateurs de Cassandra sur AWS"],"de":["Konsolidierung redundanter Spezifikationen nach Archivierung von Änderungen","Automatisierung der Erkennung von überlappenden Spezifikationen während der Exploration","Optimierung von Datenbanktests für Cassandra-Benutzer in AWS"],"pt":["Consolidar especificações redundantes após arquivar alterações","Automatizar detecção de sobreposição de especificações durante a exploração","Otimizar testes de banco de dados para usuários do Cassandra na AWS"],"ru":["Объединять избыточные спецификации после архивирования изменений","Автоматизировать обнаружение перекрывающихся спецификаций во время исследования","Оптимизировать тестирование баз данных для пользователей Cassandra в AWS"],"ar":["توحيد المواصفات الزائدة بعد أرشفة التغييرات","تأتمت كشف الت重 نقش المواصفات أثناء الاستكشاف","تحسين اختبارات قاعدة البيانات لمستخدمي Cassandra في AWS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to OpenSpec specs directory","Limited to AWS Cassandra users","Needs explicit user trigger or change archival to activate"],"zh":["需要访问OpenSpec规格目录","仅限AWS Cassandra用户","需要显式用户触发或更改存档来激活"],"ja":["OpenSpec仕様ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","AWSのCassandraユーザーに限定される","有効にするために明示的なユーザートリガーまたは変更のアーカイブが必要"],"ko":["OpenSpec 사양 디렉토리에 액세스해야 함","AWS의 Cassandra 사용자에게만 국한됨","활성화하기 위해 명시적 사용자 트리거 또는 변경 아카이브가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio de especificaciones de OpenSpec","Limitado a usuarios de Cassandra en AWS","Necesita un desencadenador de usuario explícito o un cambio de archivo para activar"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire de spécifications OpenSpec","Limité aux utilisateurs de Cassandra sur AWS","Nécessite un déclencheur d''utilisateur explicite ou un archivage de modification pour activer"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das OpenSpec-Spezifikationsverzeichnis","Begrenzt auf Cassandra-Benutzer in AWS","Benötigt einen expliziten Benachtergrund-Trigger oder eine Änderungsarchivierung, um zu aktivieren"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório de especificações OpenSpec","Limitado a usuários do Cassandra na AWS","Necessita de gatilho de usuário explícito ou arquivamento de alterações para ativar"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу спецификаций OpenSpec","Ограничен для пользователей Cassandra в AWS","Требует явного триггера пользователя или архивирования изменений для активации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى دليل مواصفات OpenSpec","محدود لمستخدمي Cassandra في AWS","يحتاج إلى تنشيط المستخدم الصريح أو أرشفة التغييرات للتنشيط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4de4ae99bd2aec9759aff13e3ef694ed03fd1e28032b684cd08942e0d0207f41","qualityScore":34}');
