INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('rustyrazorblade/easy-db-lab/openspec-consolidate-specs', 'openspec-consolidate-specs', 'rustyrazorblade', 'easy-db-lab', 'community', 'openspec-consolidate-specs rustyrazorblade easy-db-lab community cassandra The openspec-consolidate-specs skill helps developers review OpenSpec specs for overlapping functionality and propose consolidation, streamlining database testing in AWS for Cassandra users. openspec-consolidate-specs Skill 用于创建 AWS 数据库测试环境，通过优化 OpenSpec 规范以减少冗余 openspec-consolidate-specs スキルは、AWS データベーステスト環境を作成し、OpenSpec 規格を最適化して冗長性を減らすために使用されます openspec-consolidate-specs Skill은 AWS 데이터베이스 테스트 환경을 생성하고 OpenSpec 규격을 최적화하여 중복을 줄이는 데 사용됩니다 La consolidación de especificaciones OpenSpec permite eliminar la funcionalidad sobrepuesta y mejorar la eficiencia en entornos de prueba de bases de datos en AWS con Cassandra La consolidation des spécifications OpenSpec permet d''éliminer les fonctionnalités redondantes et d''améliorer l''efficacité dans les environnements de test de bases de données sur AWS avec Cassandra Die Konsolidierung von OpenSpec-Spezifikationen ermöglicht die Entfernung überlappender Funktionalitäten und die Verbesserung der Effizienz in Testumgebungen für Datenbanken in AWS mit Cassandra O openspec-consolidate-specs é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar ambientes de teste de banco de dados na AWS, permitindo a automação de processos de teste e a otimização de specs openspec-consolidate-specs - это инструмент, который помогает создавать лабораторные среды тестирования баз данных в AWS, автоматизируя тестовые процессы и оптимизируя specs openspec-consolidate-specs هو أداة تساعد في إنشاء بيئات مختبرية لاختبار قواعد البيانات في AWS، مما يسمح بتحسين عمليات الاختبار وتحسين المواصفات how to use openspec-consolidate-specs openspec-consolidate-specs setup guide what is openspec-consolidate-specs openspec-consolidate-specs alternative openspec-consolidate-specs vs spec management tools openspec-consolidate-specs install cassandra database testing aws database testing tools openspec specs consolidation openspec-consolidate-specs AWS 数据库测试环境 OpenSpec 规范 Cassandra 数据库 AI 代理 数据库测试 环境创建 Reads all specs under openspec/specs/ directory Uses parallel subagents to read specs in batches grouped by domain Triggers consolidation after archiving changes or noticing overlap Supports review of specs for overlapping functionality Proposes consolidation of specs for efficient management Streamlines database testing in AWS for Cassandra openspec-consolidate-specs is a skill that automates the review of OpenSpec specs to identify overlapping functionality and suggest consolidation.');
