dierung der Codequalität mit konfigurierbaren Schwellenwerten","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie CLI"],"pt":["Executa linting, testes e análise estática para Python, TypeScript e Rust","Verifica o tamanho dos arquivos, a cobertura de testes e a frescura das dependências","Analisar a estrutura do código para encontrar código morto e circular","Suporta configuração de limiares para validação de qualidade de código","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento de código para melhorar a produtividade","Suporta linguagens de programação como Python, TypeScript e Rust"],"ru":["Выполняет линтинг, тестирование и статический анализ для Python, TypeScript и Rust с ИИ Агентами","Проверяет размер файлов, покрытие тестов и свежесть зависимостей","Анализирует структуру кода для обнаружения мертвого кода и циклических зависимостей","Поддерживает настройку порогов для проверки качества кода","Интегрируется с инструментами разработки кода для повышения производительности","Поддерживает языки программирования как Python, TypeScript и Rust"],"ar":["يقوم بتنفيذ لينتينج واختبار وتحليل ثابت لبيثون وتايب سكريبت وروست مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","يفحص حجم الملفات وغطاء الاختبار وتازة الإعتماديات","يحلل بنية الكود لاكتشاف الكود الميت والاعتماديات الدائرية","يدعم إعداد عتبات للتحقق من جودة الكود","يتكامل مع أدوات تطوير الكود لتحسين الإنتاجية","يدعم لغات البرمجة مثل بيثون وتايب سكريبت وروست"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use run-dev-checks","run-dev-checks setup guide","run-dev-checks alternative","run-dev-checks vs linting tools","what is run-dev-checks","run-dev-checks install","automated code quality tools","language-aware development tools","botcore development command suite"],"zh":["AI工具","开发检查","语言感知命令","代码质量检查","代码结构分析","Python开发","TypeScript开发","Rust开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","開発チェック","言語認識コマンド","コード品質チェック","コード構造分析","Python開発","TypeScript開発","Rust開発"],"ko":["AI 도구","개발 체크","언어 인식 명령어","코드 품질 검사","코드 구조 분석","Python 개발","TypeScript 개발","Rust 개발"],"es":["run-dev-checks","herramientas de desarrollo","análisis de código","pruebas de código","linter","Python","TypeScript","Rust","desarrollo de software","calidad de código"],"fr":["run-dev-checks","outils de développement","analyse de code","tests de code","linter","Python","TypeScript","Rust","développement de logiciels","qualité de code"],"de":["run-dev-checks","Entwicklungstools","Code-Analyse","Code-Tests","Linter","Python","TypeScript","Rust","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität"],"pt":["run-dev-checks","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de código","linting","testes","análise estática","qualidade de código","desenvolvimento de software","python","typescript","rust","desenvolvimento de código"],"ru":["run-dev-checks","инструменты разработки кода","линтинг","тестирование","статический анализ","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","python","typescript","rust","разработка кода","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["run-dev-checks","أدوات تطوير الكود","لينتينج","اختبار","تحليل ثابت","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","بيثون","تايب سكريبت","روست","تطوير الكود","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"lushly-dev","repo":"afd","repoPath":"lushly-dev/afd","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T20:20:15Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-dev-checks","description":">","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Running Dev Checks\n\nExpert guidance for botcore''s development command suite — language-aware linting, testing, building, quality gates, and static analysis.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **Run Language-Aware Commands** -- Execute lint, test, and build using the correct tool for the detected language (Python/TypeScript/Rust)\n2. **Check Code Quality** -- Validate file sizes, test coverage, and dependency freshness against configurable thresholds\n3. **Analyze Code Structure** -- Find dead code, circular i","body":"# Running Dev Checks\n\nExpert guidance for botcore''s development command suite — language-aware linting, testing, building, quality gates, and static analysis.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **Run Language-Aware Commands** -- Execute lint, test, and build using the correct tool for the detected language (Python/TypeScript/Rust)\n2. **Check Code Quality** -- Validate file sizes, test coverage, and dependency freshness against configurable thresholds\n3. **Analyze Code Structure** -- Find dead code, circular imports, unused dependencies, and generate dependency graphs\n4. **Check Portability** -- Detect hardcoded paths that break cross-platform compatibility\n5. **Lint Skills** -- Validate skill directories against the Agent Skills format specification\n\n## Routing Logic\n\n| Request Type | Load Reference |\n|---|---|\n| dev_lint, dev_test, dev_build signatures, language dispatch | [references/core-commands.md](references/core-commands.md) |\n| dev_check_size, dev_check_coverage, dev_check_deps thresholds | [references/quality-checks.md](references/quality-checks.md) |\n| dev_dead_code, dev_circular_imports, dev_unused_deps, dev_dep_graph | [references/analysis.md](references/analysis.md) |\n| Common error codes and resolutions | [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) |\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Lefthook IS the CI Pipeline\n\n<rules>\n`pnpm check` runs the exact same steps as GitHub Actions CI. If it passes locally, CI passes remotely.\nThe quality gate runs: lint → build → typecheck → test:coverage + portability, file-size, orphan-files.\nNever add a check to CI without adding it to lefthook''s `check` group first.\nNever add a check to lefthook without verifying CI runs the same command.\nDrift between local and remote gates is a bug — the `check` group is the single source of truth.\n</rules>\n\n### 2. Three Enforcement Layers\n\n| Layer | When | Speed | What |\n|-------|------|-------|------|\n| **Pre-commit** | `git commit` | ~8s | Lint staged files, portability, file-size, typecheck |\n| **Pre-push** | `git push` | ~25s | Full lint, test, typecheck, portability, file-size, orphan-files |\n| **On-demand** (`pnpm check`) | Before release / manual | ~25s | Same as pre-push + build + test:coverage |\n\nPre-commit catches formatting. Pre-push catches regressions. `pnpm check` catches everything CI would catch.\n\n### 3. Language Dispatch Is Automatic\n\n<rules>\nDev commands read the `language`, `linter`, `test_runner`, and `formatter` from config.\nThe same `dev_lint()` call runs ruff for Python, biome for TypeScript, or clippy for Rust.\nNever hardcode tool names in scripts — let config drive tool selection.\n</rules>\n\n### 2. Thresholds Are Config-Driven\n\n<rules>\nAll quality thresholds come from `BotCoreConfig` with sensible defaults.\nOverride per-package in `[tool.botcore.packages.NAME]` for monorepos.\n</rules>\n\n| Check | Config Field | Default |\n|---|---|---|\n| File size warning | `file_size_warn` | 500 lines |\n| File size error | `file_size_error` | 1000 lines |\n| Coverage failure | `coverage_threshold` | 80% |\n| Coverage warning | `coverage_warn_threshold` | 60% |\n| Major version lag | `deps_max_major_behind` | 1 |\n| Minor version lag | `deps_max_minor_behind` | 3 |\n\n### 3. Analysis Commands Are Read-Only\n\n<rules>\nAnalysis commands (dead_code, circular_imports, unused_deps, dep_graph) report findings but never modify code.\nThey return structured data for agents to act on — the agent decides what to fix.\n</rules>\n\n## Command Overview\n\n### Core Commands (Language-Dispatched)\n\n| Command | Python | TypeScript | Rust |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `dev_lint()` | ruff check | biome lint | cargo clippy |\n| `dev_test()` | pytest | vitest run | cargo test |\n| `dev_build()` | hatch build | turbo build | cargo build |\n| `dev_skill_lint()` | (universal) | (universal) | (universal) |\n\n### Quality Commands\n\n| Command | What It Checks |\n|---|---|\n| `dev_check_size()` | Python file line counts vs thresholds |\n| `dev_check_coverage()` | Test coverage vs threshold (runs pytest --cov) |\n| `dev_check_deps()` | Dependency versions vs PyPI latest |\n\n### Analysis Commands\n\n| Command | What It Finds |\n|---|---|\n| `dev_dead_code()` | Unused functions, variables, imports (via vulture) |\n| `dev_circular_imports()` | Import cycles using AST + DFS |\n| `dev_unused_deps()` | Declared but not imported dependencies |\n| `dev_dep_graph()` | Module dependency graph (JSON or DOT) |\n\n### Portability Commands\n\n| Command | What It Detects |\n|---|---|\n| `dev_check_paths()` | Hardcoded Windows/Unix paths, localhost URLs |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Daily Development Flow\n\n1. **Write code** — make changes\n2. **Lint** — `dev_lint()` catches style and syntax issues\n3. **Test** — `dev_test()` runs the test suite\n4. **Quality gates** — `dev_check_size()`, `dev_check_coverage()` validate standards\n\n### Pre-Release Analysis\n\n1. **Dead code** — `dev_dead_code()` finds unused symbols\n2. **Circular imports** — `dev_circular_imports()` detects cycles\n3. **Unused deps** — `dev_unused_deps()` finds removable dependencies\n4. **Dep freshness** — `dev_check_deps()` checks for staleness\n5. **Portability** — `dev_check_paths()` ensures cross-platform compatibility\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] `dev_lint()` passes with no errors\n- [ ] `dev_test()` passes with no failures\n- [ ] `dev_check_size()` — no files exceed error threshold\n- [ ] `dev_check_coverage()` — meets coverage threshold\n- [ ] `dev_check_deps()` — no major-version-behind dependencies\n- [ ] `dev_circular_imports()` — within allowed cycle count\n- [ ] `dev_check_paths()` — no hardcoded platform-specific paths\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:07:39.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced language-aware linting and testing capabilities for Python, TypeScript, and Rust.","zh":"非常适合需要高级语言感知linting和测试功能的Python、TypeScript和Rust代码审查代理。","ja":"Python、TypeScript、Rustの高度な言語認識lintingおよびテスト機能を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"파이썬, 타입스크립트 및 러스트의 고급 언어 인식 linting 및 테스트 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de análisis de linter y pruebas avanzadas y conscientes del lenguaje para Python, TypeScript y Rust.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des capacités de linting et de test avancées et sensibles au langage pour Python, TypeScript et Rust.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte sprachabhängige Linting- und Testfunktionen für Python, TypeScript und Rust benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de linting e testes com conhecimento de linguagem para Python, TypeScript e Rust.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым требуются продвинутые возможности проверки и тестирования с учетом языка для Python, TypeScript и Rust.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности متقدمة للتحقق والاختبار مع دراية اللغة ل Python و TypeScript و Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute language-aware commands for linting, testing, and building, while validating code quality through configurable thresholds for file sizes, test coverage, and dependency freshness, and performing static analysis to detect dead code and circular imports.","zh":"赋予代理执行语言感知命令以进行linting、测试和构建，同时通过文件大小、测试覆盖率和依赖新鲜度的可配置阈值验证代码质量，并执行静态分析以检测死代码和循环导入。","ja":"エージェントがlinting、テスト、ビルドのための言語認識コマンドを実行できるようにし、ファイルサイズ、テストカバレッジ、依存関係の新鮮度の設定可能なしきい値を使用してコード品質を検証し、死コードと循環インポートを検出するための静的分析を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 linting, 테스트 및 빌드를 위한 언어 인식 명령을 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 파일 크기, 테스트 커버리지 및 종속성 새로움의 구성 가능한 임계 값을 사용하여 코드 품질을 검증하고, 죽은 코드 및 순환 가져오기를 감지하기 위한 정적 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comandos conscientes del lenguaje para el linter, las pruebas y la construcción, mientras valida la calidad del código a través de umbrales configurables para tamaños de archivo, cobertura de pruebas y frescura de dependencias, y realiza un análisis estático para detectar código muerto e importaciones circulares.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes sensibles au langage pour le linter, les tests et la construction, tout en validant la qualité du code via des seuils configurables pour les tailles de fichiers, la couverture des tests et la fraîcheur des dépendances, et en effectuant une analyse statique pour détecter le code mort et les imports circulaires.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sprachabhängige Befehle für Linting, Testing und Building auszuführen, während die Codequalität durch konfigurierbare Schwellenwerte für Dateigrößen, Testabdeckung und Abhängigkeitsfrische überprüft wird und eine statische Analyse zur Erkennung von totem Code und zirkulären Importen durchgeführt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar comandos com conhecimento de linguagem para linting, testes e compilação, enquanto valida a qualidade do código por meio de limiares configuráveis para tamanhos de arquivo, cobertura de teste e frescor de dependência, e realiza análise estática para detectar código morto e imports circulares.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять языково-ориентированные команды для проверки, тестирования и сборки, а также проверять качество кода с помощью настраиваемых порогов для размеров файлов, покрытия тестирования и свежести зависимостей, и выполнять статический анализ для обнаружения мертвого кода и круговых импортов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ أوامر مع دراية اللغة للتحقق والاختبار والبناء، بينما يُثبت جودة الكود من خلال عتبات قابلة للتهيئة لحجوم الملفات وتغطية الاختبار وfreshness من الاعتماد، وأداء تحليل ثابت للكشف عن الكود الميت والاستيراد الدائري."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code quality checks for Python, TypeScript, and Rust projects","Validating test coverage and dependency freshness for continuous integration pipelines","Analyzing code structure to identify dead code and circular imports"],"zh":["为Python、TypeScript和Rust项目自动执行代码质量检查","为持续集成管道验证测试覆盖率和依赖新鲜度","分析代码结构以识别死代码和循环导入"],"ja":["Python、TypeScript、Rustプロジェクトのコード品質チェックを自動化する","継続的インテグレーションパイプラインのテストカバレッジと依存関係の新鮮度を検証する","死コードと循環インポートを識別するためのコード構造の分析"],"ko":["파이썬, 타입스크립트 및 러스트 프로젝트의 코드 품질 검사를 자동화하는 것","지속적인 통합 파이프라인의 테스트 커버리지 및 종속성 새로움을 검증하는 것","죽은 코드 및 순환 가져오기를 식별하기 위한 코드 구조 분석"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de calidad de código para proyectos de Python, TypeScript y Rust","Validar la cobertura de pruebas y la frescura de dependencias para tuberías de integración continua","Analizar la estructura del código para identificar código muerto e importaciones circulares"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de la qualité du code pour les projets Python, TypeScript et Rust","Valider la couverture des tests et la fraîcheur des dépendances pour les pipelines d''intégration continue","Analyser la structure du code pour identifier le code mort et les imports circulaires"],"de":["Automatisieren von Codequalitätsprüfungen für Python-, TypeScript- und Rust-Projekte","Überprüfen der Testabdeckung und der Abhängigkeitsfrische für kontinuierliche Integrationspipelines","Analysieren der Codestruktur, um toten Code und zirkuläre Importe zu identifizieren"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de qualidade de código para projetos Python, TypeScript e Rust","Validar cobertura de teste e frescor de dependência para pipelines de integração contínua","Analizar estrutura de código para identificar código morto e imports circulares"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки качества кода для проектов Python, TypeScript и Rust","Проверять покрытие тестирования и свежесть зависимостей для конвейеров непрерывной интеграции","Анализировать структуру кода для выявления мертвого кода и круговых импортов"],"ar":["تأتمتة فحوصات جودة الكود لمشاريع Python و TypeScript و Rust","تحقق تغطية الاختبار وfreshness من الاعتماد لمخططات التكامل المستمر","تحليل هيكل الكود للكشف عن الكود الميت والاستيراد الدائري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Supports Python, TypeScript, and Rust only","Requires configuration of thresholds for file sizes, test coverage, and dependency freshness"],"zh":["仅支持Python、TypeScript和Rust","需要配置文件大小、测试覆盖率和依赖新鲜度的阈值"],"ja":["Python、TypeScript、Rustのみをサポート","ファイルサイズ、テストカバレッジ、依存関係の新鮮度のしきい値の設定が必要"],"ko":["파이썬, 타입스크립트 및 러스트만 지원함","파일 크기, 테스트 커버리지 및 종속성 새로움의 임계 값을 구성해야 함"],"es":["Solo admite Python, TypeScript y Rust","Requiere la configuración de umbrales para tamaños de archivo, cobertura de pruebas y frescura de dependencias"],"fr":["N''aide que Python, TypeScript et Rust","Nécessite la configuration de seuils pour les tailles de fichiers, la couverture des tests et la fraîcheur des dépendances"],"de":["Unterstützt nur Python, TypeScript und Rust","Erfordert die Konfiguration von Schwellenwerten für Dateigrößen, Testabdeckung und Abhängigkeitsfrische"],"pt":["Suporta apenas Python, TypeScript e Rust","Exige configuração de limiares para tamanhos de arquivo, cobertura de teste e frescor de dependência"],"ru":["Поддерживает только Python, TypeScript и Rust","Требует настройки порогов для размеров файлов, покрытия тестирования и свежести зависимостей"],"ar":["يدعم Python و TypeScript و Rust فقط","يتطلب تهيئة عتبات لحجوم الملفات وتغطية الاختبار وfreshness من الاعتماد"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8b1ea94beb5047adbb17e0afd1bdc63ad853040b44fc1ce70e8d19486cd1ebfe","qualityScore":34}');
