INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('chrispangg/deepagentsdk/custom-frontend-design', 'custom-frontend-design', 'chrispangg', 'deepagentsdk', 'community', 'custom-frontend-design chrispangg deepagentsdk community The custom-frontend-design skill creates production-grade frontend interfaces, guiding developers through design thinking and implementation with exceptional attention to aesthetic details. 自定义前端设计 skill 使用 Vercel AI SDK v6 构建独特的生产级前端界面 カスタムフロントエンドデザインスキルは Vercel AIエージェント v6 を使用して独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成 커스텀 프론트엔드 디자인 스킬은 Vercel AI SDK v6를 사용하여 고유한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성 El skill de diseño de interfaz de usuario personalizado permite la creación de interfaces de alta calidad con detalles estéticos y opciones creativas Le skill de conception d''interface utilisateur personnalisée permet la création d''interfaces de haute qualité avec des détails esthétiques et des options créatives Das Skill für benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächendesign ermöglicht die Erstellung von hochwertigen Benutzeroberflächen mit ästhetischen Details und kreativen Optionen O skill custom-frontend-design permite a criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas e de alta qualidade com Vercel''s AI SDK v6 Навык custom-frontend-design позволяет создавать индивидуальные и высококачественные интерфейсы пользователя с помощью Vercel''s AI SDK v6 المهارة custom-frontend-design تمكن من إنشاء واجهات المستخدم المخصصة والعالية الجودة باستخدام Vercel''s AI SDK v6 how to use custom-frontend-design custom-frontend-design setup guide what is custom-frontend-design custom-frontend-design alternative custom-frontend-design vs Vercel custom-frontend-design install production-grade frontend interfaces Vercel AI SDK v6 design thinking for frontend development 自定义前端设计 Vercel AI SDK v6 生产级前端界面 AI 设计 前端开发 设计思维 BOLD 美学 Implements real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details Supports design thinking for bold aesthetic direction Builds production-grade frontend interfaces using Vercel''s AI SDK v6 Allows users to provide frontend requirements and context Commits to a bold aesthetic direction before coding custom-frontend-design is a Deep Agent Harness framework that builds distinctive frontend interfaces using Vercel''s AI SDK v6, focusing on aesthetic details and creative choices.');
