Shell الذكي المكتوب بلغة Rust، مصمم لتحسين إنتاجية كتابة الشفرة في فرق وكلاء كلود كود"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"beads-workflow: AI-Optimized Task Management for Develope...","zh":"Beads Workflow 快速入门指南 - 基于 Rust 的智能 Shell 完成引擎","ja":"Beads Workflow セットアップガイド - Rust で書かれた高速な AI エージェント シェル完了エンジン","ko":"Beads Workflow 시작하기 - Rust 기반의 고성능 AI 에이전트 셸 완성 엔진","es":"Guía de configuración de Beads Workflow: Motor de autocom...","fr":"Guide de configuration de Beads Workflow: Moteur de compl...","de":"Beads Workflow-Setup-Leitfaden: Schneller, intelligenter ...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Beads-Workflow: Motor de Conclusã...","ru":"Настройка Beads-Workflow: Быстрый ИИ Агенты Движок Заверш...","ar":"دليل إعداد Beads-Workflow: محرك استكمال Shell الذكي المكت..."},"description":{"en":"Discover how beads-workflow accelerates development with automated task generation from markdown plans. Get started with this intelligent shell completion en...","zh":"了解 Beads Workflow 的功能和特点，如何将 markdown 计划转换为可执行任务，实现 AI 编码代理的高效协作","ja":"Beads Workflow の機能と特徴を紹介します。Markdown 計画を実行可能なタスクに変換し、AI エージェントの効率的な協力を実現します","ko":"Beads Workflow의 기능과 특징을 알아보세요. markdown 계획을 실행 가능한 태스크로 변환하여 AI 에이전트의 효율적인 협력을 실현합니다","es":"Optimice su flujo de trabajo con Beads Workflow, un motor de autocompletado de shell escrito en Rust para agentes de codificación de IA","fr":"Optimisez votre flux de travail avec Beads Workflow, un moteur de complétion de shell intelligent écrit en Rust pour les agents de codage IA","de":"Optimieren Sie Ihren Arbeitsablauf mit Beads Workflow, einem schnellen, intelligenten Shell-Vervollständigungs-Engine in Rust für IA-Coding-Agenten","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Beads-Workflow, um motor de conclusão de shell inteligente em Rust, para otimizar sua produtividade de codificação","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Beads-Workflow, быстрый ИИ Агенты движок завершения shell на Rust, для оптимизации вашей производительности кодирования","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد Beads-Workflow، محرك استكمال Shell الذكي المكتوب بلغة Rust، لتحسين إنتاجية كتابة الشفرة الخاصة بك"},"definition":{"en":"beads-workflow is a task management system that utilizes a dependency structure, allowing for the conversion of markdown plans into self-contained tasks for AI agents.","zh":"Beads Workflow 是一个基于 Rust 的智能 Shell 完成引擎，用于将 markdown 计划转换为可执行任务","ja":"Beads Workflow は、Rust で書かれた高速な AI エージェント シェル完了エンジンです","ko":"Beads Workflow는 Rust 기반의 고성능 AI 에이전트 셸 완성 엔진입니다","es":"Beads Workflow es un motor de autocompletado de shell inteligente que optimiza tareas y subtareas con estructura de dependencia para agentes de codificación de IA","fr":"Beads Workflow est un moteur de complétion de shell intelligent qui optimise les tâches et les sous-tâches avec une structure de dépendance pour les agents de codage IA","de":"Beads Workflow ist ein schneller, intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungs-Engine, der Tasks und Subtasks mit Abhängigkeitsstruktur für IA-Coding-Agenten optimiert","pt":"O que é Beads-Workflow? Um motor de conclusão de shell inteligente em Rust para equipes de agentes de código","ru":"Что такое Beads-Workflow? Быстрый ИИ Агенты движок завершения shell на Rust для команд агентов кода","ar":"ما هو Beads-Workflow؟ محرك استكمال Shell الذكي المكتوب بلغة Rust لفرق وكلاء الكود"},"features":{"en":["Converts markdown plans into beads with dependency structure","Iteratively polishes tasks across multiple rounds and models","Coordinates parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams","Optimizes task management for AI coding agents","Written in Rust for high performance","Supports full lifecycle task management"],"zh":["基于 Rust 的高性能实现","支持将 markdown 计划转换为可执行任务","实现 AI 编码代理的高效协作","支持多轮迭代和模型优化","支持并行执行和 Claude Code 代理团队协调"],"ja":["Rust で書かれた高速な実装","Markdown 計画を実行可能なタスクに変換する機能","AI エージェントの効率的な協力を実現","複数の反復とモデル最適化のサポート","並列実行と Claude Code エージェントチームのコーディネーションのサポート"],"ko":["Rust 기반의 고성능 구현","markdown 계획을 실행 가능한 태스크로 변환하는 기능","AI 에이전트의 효율적인 협력을 실현","다중 반복과 모델 최적화의 지원","병렬 실행과 Claude Code 에이전트 팀의 협조의 지원"],"es":["Motor de autocompletado de shell inteligente escrito en Rust","Optimización de epics, tareas y subtareas con estructura de dependencia","Conversión de planes de markdown en tareas implementables","Ejecución paralela mediante equipos de agentes de Claude Code","Polish de tareas a través de múltiples rondas y modelos","Integración con agentes de codificación de IA"],"fr":["Moteur de complétion de shell intelligent écrit en Rust","Optimisation des épopées, des tâches et des sous-tâches avec une structure de dépendance","Conversion de plans de markdown en tâches implementables","Exécution parallèle via des équipes d''agents de Claude Code","Polissage de tâches à travers plusieurs rondes et modèles","Intégration avec les agents de codage IA"],"de":["Schneller, intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungs-Engine in Rust","Optimierung von Epics, Tasks und Subtasks mit Abhängigkeitsstruktur","Konvertierung von Markdown-Plänen in implementierbare Tasks","Parallele Ausführung via Claude Code-Agententeams","Polish von Tasks über mehrere Runden und Modelle","Integration mit IA-Coding-Agenten"],"pt":["Conversão de planos em markdown para beads","Otimização de tarefas e subtarefas com estrutura de dependência","Execução paralela via equipes de agentes de código Claude","Iteração de refinamento de tarefas em múltiplas rodadas e modelos","Desenvolvido em Rust para alta performance"],"ru":["Преобразование планов в markdown в beads","Оптимизация задач и подзадач с структурой зависимости","Параллельное выполнение через команды агентов кода Claude","Итерация усовершенствования задач в нескольких раундах и моделях","Разработан на Rust для высокой производительности"],"ar":["تحويل الخطط من markdown إلى beads","تحسين المهام والمهام الفرعية مع هيكل التبعية","تنفيذ موازٍ عبر فرق وكلاء الكود كلود","تكرار تحسين المهام في جولات متعددة وأشكال","تم تطويره بلغة Rust لتحقيق أداء عالٍ"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use beads-workflow","beads-workflow alternative","beads-workflow setup guide","what is beads-workflow","beads-workflow vs Linear","beads-workflow install","beads-workflow for AI agents","Rust-based task management","markdown plan conversion","Claude Code agent teams"],"zh":["Beads Workflow","Rust","AI 编码代理","Shell 完成引擎","markdown 计划","可执行任务","AI 工具","代码生成"],"ja":["Beads Workflow","Rust","AI エージェント","シェル完了エンジン","Markdown 計画","実行可能なタスク","AI エージェント","コード生成"],"ko":["Beads Workflow","Rust","AI 에이전트","셸 완성 엔진","markdown 계획","실행 가능한 태스크","AI 도구","코드 생성"],"es":["Beads Workflow","motor de autocompletado de shell","agentes de codificación de IA","Rust","markdown","epics","tareas","subtareas","estructura de dependencia","autocompletado de shell inteligente"],"fr":["Beads Workflow","moteur de complétion de shell","agents de codage IA","Rust","markdown","épopées","tâches","sous-tâches","structure de dépendance","complétion de shell intelligent"],"de":["Beads Workflow","Shell-Vervollständigungs-Engine","IA-Coding-Agenten","Rust","Markdown","Epics","Tasks","Subtasks","Abhängigkeitsstruktur","intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungs-Engine"],"pt":["Beads-Workflow","motor de conclusão de shell","Rust","equipes de agentes de código","produtividade de codificação","otimização de tarefas","execução paralela"," Claude Code"],"ru":["Beads-Workflow","ИИ Агенты","движок завершения shell","Rust","команды агентов кода","производительность кодирования","оптимизация задач","параллельное выполнение","Claude Code"],"ar":["Beads-Workflow","محرك استكمال Shell","Rust","فرق وكلاء الكود","إنتاجية كتابة الشفرة","تحسين المهام","تنفيذ موازٍ","كلود كود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"jbabin91","repo":"autocomplete-rs","repoPath":"jbabin91/autocomplete-rs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.331Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"beads-workflow","description":"Converts markdown plans into beads (tasks with dependencies) and polishes them until implementation-ready. The bridge between planning and agent team execution. Use when converting a plan to beads, polishing bead descriptions, adding test coverage beads, reviewing bead dependencies, or preparing tasks for parallel agent team execution.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# Beads Workflow\n\nBeads are epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structure, optimized for AI coding agents. They function like Jira or Linear but designed for machines. This skill covers the full lifecycle: converting markdown plans into beads, iteratively polishing them across multiple rounds and models, and coordinating parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams. Use this when you have a markdown plan and need to produce self-contained, implementation-ready tasks. Do not use this for","body":"# Beads Workflow\n\nBeads are epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structure, optimized for AI coding agents. They function like Jira or Linear but designed for machines. This skill covers the full lifecycle: converting markdown plans into beads, iteratively polishing them across multiple rounds and models, and coordinating parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams. Use this when you have a markdown plan and need to produce self-contained, implementation-ready tasks. Do not use this for the planning phase itself; use a planning skill for that.\n\n> **Core Principle:** \"Check your beads N times, implement once\" -- where N is as many as you can stomach.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Workflow             | What It Does                                                   | Key Detail                                                              |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Plan to beads        | Converts a markdown plan into granular beads with dependencies | Use the full or short conversion prompt with `bd` tool                  |\n| Polish beads         | Iteratively reviews and improves bead quality                  | Run 6-9 rounds until steady-state; use full or standard prompt          |\n| Fresh session        | Breaks out of polishing plateaus                               | Start new session, re-establish context, then resume polishing          |\n| Cross-model review   | Gets alternative perspectives on bead quality                  | Run final pass with a different model (Codex, Gemini CLI)               |\n| Add test coverage    | Creates unit test and e2e test beads                           | Use the test coverage prompt to audit and fill gaps                     |\n| bd CLI basics        | Create, update, depend, close beads                            | Always use `bd` tool; never run bare `bv` (interactive TUI)             |\n| Robot mode           | Machine-readable bv output for agents                          | `bv --robot-triage`, `--robot-next`, `--robot-plan`, `--robot-insights` |\n| Agent team execution | Coordinate parallel bead execution via Claude Code agent teams | Beads = persistent truth; team tasks = ephemeral dispatch               |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake                                                  | Correct Pattern                                                                                                |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Oversimplifying bead descriptions to short bullet points | Beads must be verbose and self-documenting with background, reasoning, and considerations                      |\n| Stopping after one polish round                          | Keep polishing until steady-state (typically 6-9 rounds); start a fresh session if progress flatlines          |\n| Omitting test coverage beads                             | Every feature bead should have associated unit test and e2e test beads with detailed logging                   |\n| Not making all blocking relationships explicit           | Use `bd depend` to declare every dependency; agents cannot infer implicit ordering                             |\n| Losing features from the original plan                   | Cross-check every plan section against beads; everything must be embedded so the plan is never consulted again |\n| Running bare `bv` without flags                          | Always use `bv --robot-*` flags; bare `bv` launches an interactive TUI that blocks agents                      |\n| Teammates editing the same files                         | Assign exclusive file ownership per teammate; work same-file beads sequentially                                |\n\n## Delegation\n\n- **Create initial beads from a markdown plan**: Use `Task` agent with the plan-to-beads prompt and `bd` tool access\n- **Polish beads across multiple rounds**: Use `Task` agent with the standard polish prompt, repeating until steady-state\n- **Review bead graph for cycles and missing dependencies**: Use `Explore` agent to run `bv --robot-insights` and validate the dependency structure\n- **Add test coverage beads**: Use `Task` agent with the test coverage prompt\n- **Execute beads in parallel**: Use agent teams -- lead discovers parallel tracks via `bd ready`/`bv --robot-plan`, spawns teammates with bead-scoped prompts, verifies and closes beads after completion\n\n## References\n\n- [Plan to Beads](references/plan-to-beads.md) -- Converting markdown plans into beads, exact prompts, what gets created\n- [Polishing Workflow](references/polishing-workflow.md) -- Polishing protocol, fresh session technique, cross-model review, quality checklist\n- [Agent Integration](references/agent-integration.md) -- bd CLI commands, robot mode, agent team execution, test coverage beads\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:15.233Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents needing task management optimization through markdown plan conversion and dependency structure analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要通过markdown计划转换和依赖结构分析来优化任务管理的AI编码代理。","ja":"タスク管理の最適化をマークダウン計画の変換と依存関係構造の分析を通じて必要とするAIコーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"마크다운 계획 변환 및 종속 구조 분석을 통해 태스크 관리를 최적화해야 하는 AI 코딩 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación de IA que necesitan optimización de la gestión de tareas a través de la conversión de planes de markdown y análisis de estructuras de dependencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage IA ayant besoin d''une optimisation de la gestion des tâches via la conversion de plans markdown et l''analyse de structures de dépendance.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Agents, die eine Optimierung der Aufgabenverwaltung durch die Konvertierung von Markdown-Plänen und die Analyse von Abhängigkeitsstrukturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação de IA que necessitam de otimização de gerenciamento de tarefas por meio de conversão de planos em markdown e análise de estrutura de dependência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, которым требуется оптимизация управления задачами посредством преобразования планов markdown в анализ структуры зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين إدارة المهمات من خلال تحويل الخطة إلى تنسيق markdown وتحليل هيكل الاعتماد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert markdown plans into implementation-ready tasks with dependency structures, leveraging Rust for optimized performance and integrating seamlessly with Claude Code agent teams for parallel execution via iterative polishing across multiple rounds and models, utilizing protocols like task coordination.","zh":"赋予代理将markdown计划转换为可执行任务的能力，具有依赖结构，并利用Rust实现优化的性能，并与Claude Code代理团队无缝集成，通过多轮和多模型的迭代抛光实现并行执行，使用诸如任务协调等协议。","ja":"マークダウン計画を依存関係構造を備えた実行可能なタスクに変換する機能をエージェントに与え、Rustを使用してパフォーマンスを最適化し、Claude Codeエージェントチームとシームレスに統合して、繰り返し磨き込みを使用して複数のラウンドとモデルで並行実行を実現し、タスク調整などのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"마크다운 계획을 종속 구조를 갖춘 실행 가능한 태스크로 변환하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, Rust를 사용하여 성능을 최적화하고, Claude Code 에이전트 팀과 무끝으로 통합하여, 여러 라운드와 모델에서 병렬 실행을 thực現하기 위해 반복적인 다듬기를 사용하며, 태스크 조정 등 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir planes de markdown en tareas listas para implementar con estructuras de dependencia, aprovechando Rust para un rendimiento optimizado e integrándose perfectamente con equipos de agentes de Claude Code para la ejecución paralela a través del pulido iterativo en varias rondas y modelos, utilizando protocolos como la coordinación de tareas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des plans markdown en tâches prêtes à l''exécution avec des structures de dépendance, en exploitant Rust pour des performances optimisées et en s''intégrant parfaitement avec les équipes d''agents Claude Code pour l''exécution parallèle via un polissage itératif sur plusieurs tours et modèles, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la coordination des tâches.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Markdown-Pläne in implementierbare Aufgaben mit Abhängigkeitsstrukturen umzuwandeln, wobei Rust für optimierte Leistung genutzt wird und nahtlos in Claude Code-Agententeams für parallele Ausführung durch iteratives Polieren über mehrere Runden und Modelle integriert wird, unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie Aufgabenkoordination.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter planos em markdown em tarefas prontas para implementação com estruturas de dependência, aproveitando Rust para desempenho otimizado e integrando-se perfeitamente com equipes de agentes Claude Code para execução paralela via polimento iterativo em várias rodadas e modelos, utilizando protocolos como coordenação de tarefas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать планы markdown в задачи, готовые к реализации, со структурами зависимостей, используя Rust для оптимизированного производительности и интегрируясь без проблем с командами агентов Claude Code для параллельного выполнения через итеративную полировку в нескольких раундах и моделях, используя протоколы, такие как координация задач.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تحويل الخطط المكتوبة بتنسيق markdown إلى مهام جاهزة للتنفيذ مع هيكل الاعتماد، مستفيداً من Rust لتحقيق الأداء الأمثل وتكاملها بشكل متوافق مع فرق عميل Claude Code لتنفيذ متوازي عبر طريقة تلميع متكرر عبر عدة جولات ونماذج، مستخدماً بروتوكولات مثل تنسيق المهام."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting markdown plans into executable tasks","Managing epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structures","Coordinating parallel execution of tasks via Claude Code agent teams"],"zh":["将markdown计划转换为可执行任务","使用依赖结构管理史诗、任务和子任务","通过Claude Code代理团队协调任务的并行执行"],"ja":["マークダウン計画を実行可能なタスクに変換する","依存関係構造を使用してエピック、タスク、サブタスクを管理する","Claude Codeエージェントチームを使用してタスクの並行実行を調整する"],"ko":["마크다운 계획을 실행 가능한 태스크로 변환하는","종속 구조를 사용하여 에픽, 태스크, 서브태스크를 관리하는","Claude Code 에이전트 팀을 사용하여 태스크의 병렬 실행을 조정하는"],"es":["Conversión de planes de markdown en tareas ejecutables","Gestión de épicos, tareas y subtareas con estructuras de dependencia","Coordinación de la ejecución paralela de tareas a través de equipos de agentes de Claude Code"],"fr":["Conversion de plans markdown en tâches exécutables","Gestion d''épics, de tâches et de sous-tâches avec des structures de dépendance","Coordination de l''exécution parallèle des tâches via les équipes d''agents Claude Code"],"de":["Konvertierung von Markdown-Plänen in ausführbare Aufgaben","Verwaltung von Epics, Aufgaben und Unter-Aufgaben mit Abhängigkeitsstrukturen","Koordinierung der parallelen Ausführung von Aufgaben über Claude Code-Agententeams"],"pt":["Converter planos em markdown em tarefas executáveis","Gerenciar épicos, tarefas e subtarefas com estruturas de dependência","Coordenar a execução paralela de tarefas via equipes de agentes Claude Code"],"ru":["Преобразование планов markdown в исполняемые задачи","Управление эпики, задачами и подзадачами со структурами зависимостей","Координация параллельного выполнения задач через команды агентов Claude Code"],"ar":["تحويل الخطط المكتوبة بتنسيق markdown إلى مهام قابلة للتنفيذ","إدارة الملحم، المهام والمهام الفرعية مع هيكل الاعتماد","تنسيق تنفيذ المهام بشكل متوازي عبر فرق عميل Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires markdown plan as input","Designed specifically for AI coding agents","Not suitable for non-technical or generic task management"],"zh":["需要markdown计划作为输入","专门为AI编码代理设计","不适合非技术或通用任务管理"],"ja":["マークダウン計画を入力として必要とする","AIコーディングエージェント専用に設計されている","非技術的または一般的なタスク管理には適さない"],"ko":["마크다운 계획을 입력으로 필요로 함","AI 코딩 에이전트 전용으로 설계됨","비기술적 또는 일반 태스크 관리에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere un plan de markdown como entrada","Diseñado específicamente para agentes de codificación de IA","No es adecuado para la gestión de tareas no técnicas o genéricas"],"fr":["Nécessite un plan markdown comme entrée","Conçu spécifiquement pour les agents de codage IA","Non adapté à la gestion de tâches non techniques ou génériques"],"de":["Benötigt einen Markdown-Plan als Eingabe","Speziell für AI-Coding-Agents konzipiert","Nicht geeignet für nicht-technische oder generische Aufgabenverwaltung"],"pt":["Requer um plano em markdown como entrada","Projetado especificamente para agentes de codificação de IA","Não é adequado para gerenciamento de tarefas não técnicas ou genéricas"],"ru":["Требует плана markdown в качестве входных данных","Разработан специально для агентов кодирования ИИ","Не подходит для не-технического или общего управления задачами"],"ar":["يتطلب خطة بتنسيق markdown كمدخل","صُمم خصيصاً لعميل الترميز الاصطناعي","لا يصلح لإدارة المهام غير التقنية أو العامة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4aa1183739ca667e61e394959269df4080be184c2f88bc5522b422d11a404366","qualityScore":34}');
