 zur Verbesserung der Codequalität","Erweitertes technisches Support mit KI-Technologien","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie Node.js und CLI","Fähigkeit zur automatischen Refaktorierung","Code-Analyse und Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Suporte técnico personalizado","Análise de dados avançada","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas"],"ru":["Персонализированная техническая поддержка","Продвинутый анализ данных","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс","Поддержка нескольких языков"],"ar":["دعم فني شخصي","تحليل بيانات متقدم","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام","دعم لعدة لغات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD 工具","红绿重构","AI 测试工具","自动化测试","代码重构","测试驱动开发","如何使用 TDD","TDD 教程"],"ja":["TDD ツール","レッドグリーンリファクタリング","AI テストツール","自動テスト","コードリファクタリング","テスト駆動開発","TDD の使い方","TDD チュートリアル"],"ko":["TDD 도구","빨강초록 리팩토링","AI 테스트 도구","자동 테스트","코드 리팩토링","테스트 주도 개발","TDD 사용법","TDD 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","tdd-red-green-refactor","soporte técnico con AI","cómo implementar TDD","herramientas de desarrollo para Node.js","alternativas a tdd-red-green-refactor","guía de instalación de tdd-red-green-refactor","tdd-red-green-refactor vs Jest"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","tdd-red-green-refactor","support technique avec IA","comment implémenter le TDD","outils de développement pour Node.js","alternatives à tdd-red-green-refactor","guide d''installation de tdd-red-green-refactor","tdd-red-green-refactor vs Jest"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","tdd-red-green-refactor","technischer Support mit KI","wie man TDD implementiert","Entwicklungstools für Node.js","Alternativen zu tdd-red-green-refactor","Installationsanleitung für tdd-red-green-refactor","tdd-red-green-refactor vs Jest"],"pt":["como usar tdd-red-green-refactor","o que é tdd-red-green-refactor","tdd-red-green-refactor alternativa","tdd-red-green-refactor vs competitor","instalar tdd-red-green-refactor","guia de configuração tdd-red-green-refactor","desenvolvimento de software com tdd-red-green-refactor"],"ru":["как использовать tdd-red-green-refactor","что такое tdd-red-green-refactor","альтернатива tdd-red-green-refactor","tdd-red-green-refactor vs конкурент","установка tdd-red-green-refactor","руководство по настройке tdd-red-green-refactor","разработка программного обеспечения с tdd-red-green-refactor"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام tdd-red-green-refactor","ما هي tdd-red-green-refactor","بديل tdd-red-green-refactor","tdd-red-green-refactor مقابل المنافس","تثبيت tdd-red-green-refactor","دليل إعداد tdd-red-green-refactor","تطوير البرمجيات مع tdd-red-green-refactor"]}},"owner":"skillrecordings","repo":"support","repoPath":"skillrecordings/support","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T13:13:22.569Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-red-green-refactor","description":"Enforce TDD workflow (red → green → refactor). Use for any code change that is testable.","bodyPreview":"# TDD Red / Green / Refactor\n\nUse this skill whenever making code changes that should be covered by tests.\n\n## Non-negotiables\n- Start with a failing test that expresses the behavior (red).\n- Implement the smallest change to pass (green).\n- Refactor for clarity/structure after green, keeping tests passing.\n- If no tests exist, add a minimal test harness + a failing test first.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Identify the smallest observable behavior.\n2. Add or update a test to fail on current code.\n3. Run the s","body":"# TDD Red / Green / Refactor\n\nUse this skill whenever making code changes that should be covered by tests.\n\n## Non-negotiables\n- Start with a failing test that expresses the behavior (red).\n- Implement the smallest change to pass (green).\n- Refactor for clarity/structure after green, keeping tests passing.\n- If no tests exist, add a minimal test harness + a failing test first.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Identify the smallest observable behavior.\n2. Add or update a test to fail on current code.\n3. Run the smallest relevant test command (targeted if possible).\n4. Implement the minimal code to make it pass.\n5. Refactor with tests still green.\n6. Report: test command(s) run + results.\n\n## If tests cannot run\n- State why (missing deps, env, credentials, etc.).\n- Still write the failing test first and note the expected outcome.\n- Provide a suggested test command for the user to run.\n\n## Test targeting\nPrefer the narrowest scope:\n- single file\n- package-level\n- repo-level only if needed\n\n## Typecheck policy\n\nTypes always pass. Do not blame pre-existing errors. Fix or revert.\n\n## WE USE VITEST - NOT BUN:TEST\n\n**This is non-negotiable.** Never use `bun:test` imports or APIs.\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT - Vitest\nimport { describe, it, expect, vi, beforeEach } from ''vitest''\n\n// ❌ WRONG - bun:test (DO NOT USE)\nimport { describe, it, expect, mock } from ''bun:test''\n```\n\n### Test commands\n\n```bash\n# All tests via Turborepo\nbun run test\n\n# Filtered by package\nbun run test --filter=@skillrecordings/core\nbun run test --filter=web\n\n# Direct Vitest (when you need fine-grained control)\nbun run test:all\nbun run test:all -- -t \"name of test\"\nbun run test:all -- packages/core/src/tools/process-refund.test.ts\n```\n\n### Common Vitest patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Mocking\nconst mockFn = vi.fn()\nvi.mocked(someModule).someMethod.mockResolvedValue(result)\n\n// Hoisting mocks (required for factory functions)\nconst mockClient = vi.hoisted(() => ({ method: vi.fn() }))\nvi.mock(''./client'', () => ({ client: mockClient }))\n\n// Spying\nvi.spyOn(object, ''method'').mockImplementation(...)\n```\n\n## Notes to include in the response\n- Which test you wrote first.\n- The command used to hit red and green.\n- Any refactor that changed structure but not behavior.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:57:00.248Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents requiring test-driven development capabilities with red-green-refactor workflow.","zh":"适合需要测试驱动开发能力的敏捷开发代理，具有红绿重构工作流程。","ja":"テスト駆動開発機能とred-green-refactorワークフローを必要とするAgile開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"테스트 주도 개발 기능 및 red-green-refactor 워크 플로가 필요한 애자일 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo Agile que requieren capacidades de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas con flujo de trabajo red-green-refactor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Agile nécessitant des capacités de développement piloté par les tests avec un flux de travail red-green-refactor.","de":"Perfekt für Agile-Entwicklungsagenten, die Test-getriebene Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit Red-Green-Refactor-Workflow benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Ágil que exigem capacidades de desenvolvimento orientado a testes com fluxo de trabalho red-green-refactor.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Agile-разработки, требующих возможностей разработки, управляемой тестированием, с рабочим процессом red-green-refactor.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الرشيق الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التطوير الموجهة بالاختبار مع تدفق العمل الأحمر والأخضر وإعادة الهيكلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust testing frameworks, utilizing failing tests to drive minimal code changes, and refactoring for clarity and structure, all while maintaining passing tests through protocols like TDD and frameworks such as unittest or pytest.","zh":"赋予代理实施强大的测试框架的能力，利用失败的测试来驱动最小的代码更改，并通过协议如TDD和框架如unittest或pytest来重构以提高清晰度和结构，同时保持通过测试。","ja":"エージェントに強力なテストフレームワークを実装する能力を付与し、失敗したテストを利用して最小限のコード変更を駆動し、TDDやunittest、pytestなどのフレームワークなどのプロトコルを通じて、通過テストを維持しながら、明確性と構造を高めるためのリファクタリングを行う。","ko":"에이전트에 강력한 테스트 프레임워크를 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 실패한 테스트를 사용하여 최소한의 코드 변경을 구동하고, TDD 및 unittest, pytest와 같은 프레임워크와 같은 프로토콜을 통해, 테스트를 통과하면서, 명확성과 구조를 높이기 위한 리팩토링을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar frameworks de pruebas robustos, utilizando pruebas fallidas para impulsar cambios mínimos de código y refactorizar para claridad y estructura, manteniendo pruebas aprobatorias a través de protocolos como TDD y frameworks como unittest o pytest.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des frameworks de test robustes, en utilisant des tests qui échouent pour impulser des changements minimaux de code et en refactorisant pour la clarté et la structure, tout en maintenant des tests réussis à travers des protocoles tels que TDD et des frameworks tels que unittest ou pytest.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste Testframeworks zu implementieren, fehlgeschlagene Tests zu nutzen, um minimale Codeänderungen voranzutreiben, und umzustrukturieren, um Klarheit und Struktur zu gewährleisten, während sie bestandene Tests durch Protokolle wie TDD und Frameworks wie unittest oder pytest beibehalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar estruturas de teste robustas, utilizando testes com falha para impulsionar alterações mínimas de código e reorganizar para clareza e estrutura, mantendo testes aprovados por meio de protocolos como TDD e estruturas como unittest ou pytest.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать прочные тестовые фреймворки, используя неудачные тесты для стимулирования минимальных изменений кода и рефакторинга для ясности и структуры, сохраняя при этом проходящие тесты через протоколы, такие как TDD, и фреймворки, такие как unittest или pytest.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ إطارات اختبار قوية، باستخدام الاختبارات الفاشلة لتحفيز تغييرات кодية صغيرة، وإعادة هيكلة لتوضيح البنية، مع الحفاظ على الاختبارات الناجحة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل TDD وإطارات مثل unittest أو pytest."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing test-driven development for new features","Refactoring legacy code with test coverage","Debugging existing tests to ensure correct functionality"],"zh":["为新功能实现测试驱动开发","使用测试覆盖率重构遗留代码","调试现有测试以确保正确的功能性"],"ja":["新機能のテスト駆動開発の実装","テストカバレッジを使用したレガシーコードのリファクタリング","既存のテストのデバッグにより正常な機能性を確保"],"ko":["새로운 기능을 위한 테스트 주도 개발 구현","테스트 커버리지 사용을 통한 레거시 코드 리팩토링","기존 테스트의 디버깅을 통해 올바른 기능性 확보"],"es":["Implementar desarrollo dirigido por pruebas para nuevas características","Reestructurar código heredado con cobertura de pruebas","Depurar pruebas existentes para garantizar la funcionalidad correcta"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le développement piloté par les tests pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Réorganiser le code hérité avec une couverture de tests","Déboguer les tests existants pour assurer la fonctionnalité correcte"],"de":["Test-getriebene Entwicklung für neue Funktionen implementieren","Legacy-Code mit Testabdeckung neu strukturieren","Vorhandene Tests debuggen, um die korrekte Funktionalität sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Implementar desenvolvimento orientado a testes para recursos novos","Reorganizar código legado com cobertura de teste","Depurar testes existentes para garantir funcionalidade correta"],"ru":["Реализация разработки, управляемой тестированием, для новых функций","Рефакторинг устаревшего кода с покрытием тестирования","Отладка существующих тестов для обеспечения правильной функциональности"],"ar":["تنفيذ التطوير الموجه بالاختبار لميزات جديدة","إعادة هيكلة Код الوراثة مع تغطية الاختبار","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبارات الحالية لضمان الوظائف الصحيحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing test harness or framework","Dependent on specific programming language support for TDD"],"zh":["需要现有的测试工具或框架","依赖于特定编程语言对TDD的支持"],"ja":["既存のテストハーネスまたはフレームワークが必要","特定のプログラミング言語によるTDDサポートへの依存"],"ko":["既存의 테스트 하네스 또는 프레임워크가 필요","특정 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 TDD 지원에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un arnés de pruebas o framework existente","Dependiente del soporte de lenguaje de programación específico para TDD"],"fr":["Nécessite un harnais de tests ou un framework existant","Dépend du support de langage de programmation spécifique pour TDD"],"de":["Benötigt einen vorhandenen Testharnisch oder Framework","Abhängig von der Unterstützung einer bestimmten Programmiersprache für TDD"],"pt":["Exige um conjunto de testes existente ou estrutura","Dependente do suporte de linguagem de programação específica para TDD"],"ru":["Требует существующего набора тестов или фреймворка","Зависит от поддержки конкретного языка программирования для TDD"],"ar":["يتطلب حزمة اختبار موجودة أو إطار","يعتمد على دعم لغة برمجة محددة لـ TDD"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5031433fb4184b5bce5a577c12e434ca9414230f2602e21e301a42a16acecebe","qualityScore":34}');
