","Spielentwicklung mit Defold","Entwicklungstools für Spiele"],"pt":["Defold Build","módulo Lua","Poki AUDS","http.request Defold","baixar Defold bob.jar","testes de fumça","verificar versão Java","desenvolvimento de jogos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Defold Build","модуль Lua","Poki AUDS","http.request Defold","загрузить Defold bob.jar","тесты","проверить версию Java","разработка игр","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أداة Defold Build","وحدة لوح لغة Lua","Poki AUDS","طلب HTTP من Defold","تنزيل Defold bob.jar","اختبارات الدخان","التحقق من إصدار Java","تطوير الألعاب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"indiesoftby","repo":"defold-poki-auds","repoPath":"indiesoftby/defold-poki-auds","stars":4,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-03T20:16:07Z","topics":["defold","defold-library","lua","poki","remote-config"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"defold-build","description":"Downloads Defold bob.jar and runs smoke test builds. Use when asked to build, test build, or verify Defold project compiles.","bodyPreview":"# Defold Build Skill\n\nDownloads the latest stable Defold bob.jar and runs smoke test builds.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Java 25+ (`java -version` to verify)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Check Java Version\n\n```bash\njava -version\n```\n\nEnsure version 25 or higher.\n\n### 2. Download bob.jar\n\nRun the appropriate script for the platform:\n\n**Windows (PowerShell):**\n```powershell\nscripts/download-bob.ps1\n```\n\n**Linux/macOS (Bash):**\n```bash\nscripts/download-bob.sh\n```\n\n### 3. Run Smoke Test Build\n\nAfter bob.jar is down","body":"# Defold Build Skill\n\nDownloads the latest stable Defold bob.jar and runs smoke test builds.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Java 25+ (`java -version` to verify)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Check Java Version\n\n```bash\njava -version\n```\n\nEnsure version 25 or higher.\n\n### 2. Download bob.jar\n\nRun the appropriate script for the platform:\n\n**Windows (PowerShell):**\n```powershell\nscripts/download-bob.ps1\n```\n\n**Linux/macOS (Bash):**\n```bash\nscripts/download-bob.sh\n```\n\n### 3. Run Smoke Test Build\n\nAfter bob.jar is downloaded, run:\n\n```bash\njava -jar .internal/bob.jar --platform x86_64-win32 --variant debug --archive build\n```\n\n#### Platform Options\n\n| OS | Platform Flag |\n|----|---------------|\n| Windows 64-bit | `x86_64-win32` |\n| macOS x64 | `x86_64-macos` |\n| macOS ARM | `arm64-macos` |\n| Linux 64-bit | `x86_64-linux` |\n| HTML5 | `js-web` |\n| Android | `armv7-android` or `arm64-android` |\n| iOS | `arm64-ios` |\n\n#### Variant Options\n\n- `debug` - Debug build with symbols\n- `release` - Optimized release build\n\n## Full Example (Windows)\n\n```powershell\n# Download bob.jar if needed\n& \".agents/skills/defold-build/scripts/download-bob.ps1\"\n\n# Run smoke test\njava -jar .internal/bob.jar --platform x86_64-win32 --variant debug --archive build\n```\n\n## Full Example (Linux/macOS)\n\n```bash\n# Download bob.jar if needed\nbash .agents/skills/defold-build/scripts/download-bob.sh\n\n# Run smoke test\njava -jar .internal/bob.jar --platform x86_64-linux --variant debug --archive build\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Java not found**: Install Java 25+ and ensure it''s in PATH\n- **Build fails**: Check output logs for errors\n- **bob.jar corrupted**: Delete `.internal/bob.jar` and re-download\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:59:22.974Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents needing automated Defold builds and smoke testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化Defold构建和烟雾测试功能的游戏开发代理。","ja":"Defoldの自動化されたビルドとスモークテスト機能を必要とするゲーム開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 Defold 빌드 및 스모크 테스트 기능이 필요한 게임 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que necesitan compilaciones automatizadas de Defold y capacidades de pruebas de humo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de jeux ayant besoin de builds Defold automatisés et de capacités de test de fumée.","de":"Perfekt für Game-Development-Agents, die automatisierte Defold-Builds und Smoke-Test-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de jogos que precisam de compilações automatizadas do Defold e capacidades de teste de fumaça.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, которым необходимы автоматизированные сборки Defold и возможности тестирования на дым.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الألعاب التي تحتاج إلى عمليات بناء Defold آليّة وقدرات اختبار الدخان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline Defold development by downloading the latest stable Defold bob.jar and running smoke test builds using Poki AUDS, ensuring seamless Java 25+ integration.","zh":"通过下载最新的稳定Defold bob.jar并使用Poki AUDS运行烟雾测试构建来赋予代理简化Defold开发的能力，确保无缝的Java 25+集成。","ja":"最新の安定したDefold bob.jarをダウンロードし、Poki AUDSを使用してスモークテストビルドを実行することで、エージェントはDefold開発を簡素化し、Java 25+とのシームレスな統合を保証する。","ko":"최신 안정적인 Defold bob.jar를 다운로드하고 Poki AUDS를 사용하여 스모크 테스트 빌드를 실행함으로써 에이전트가 Defold 개발을 간소화하고 Java 25+와의无缝한 통합을 보장할 수 있다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el desarrollo de Defold descargando el último Defold bob.jar estable y ejecutando builds de pruebas de humo utilizando Poki AUDS, garantizando una integración Java 25+ sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser le développement Defold en téléchargeant le dernier Defold bob.jar stable et en exécutant des builds de test de fumée à l''aide de Poki AUDS, garantissant une intégration Java 25+ sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Defold-Entwicklung durch Herunterladen des neuesten stabilen Defold bob.jar und Ausführen von Smoke-Test-Builds mit Poki AUDS zu optimieren, um eine nahtlose Java 25+-Integration zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desenvolvimento do Defold ao baixar o Defold bob.jar estável mais recente e executar compilações de teste de fumaça usando o Poki AUDS, garantindo uma integração Java 25+ sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать разработку Defold, скачивая последний стабильный Defold bob.jar и запуская сборки тестирования на дым с помощью Poki AUDS, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию Java 25+.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين تطوير Defold عن طريق تحميل Defold bob.jar المستقر الأكثر حداثة و تشغيل عمليات بناء اختبار الدخان باستخدام Poki AUDS، و ذلك لضمان تكامل Java 25+ بدون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Defold build processes","Running smoke tests for Defold projects","Downloading latest stable Defold bob.jar"],"zh":["自动化Defold构建过程","运行Defold项目的烟雾测试","下载最新的稳定Defold bob.jar"],"ja":["Defoldのビルドプロセスの自動化","Defoldプロジェクトのスモークテストの実行","最新の安定したDefold bob.jarのダウンロード"],"ko":["Defold 빌드 프로세스의 자동화","Defold 프로젝트의 스모크 테스트 실행","최신 안정적인 Defold bob.jar 다운로드"],"es":["Automatizar procesos de compilación de Defold","Ejecutar pruebas de humo para proyectos de Defold","Descargar el último Defold bob.jar estable"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de build Defold","Exécuter des tests de fumée pour les projets Defold","Télécharger le dernier Defold bob.jar stable"],"de":["Automatisierung von Defold-Build-Prozessen","Ausführen von Smoke-Tests für Defold-Projekte","Herunterladen des neuesten stabilen Defold bob.jar"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de compilação do Defold","Executar testes de fumaça para projetos Defold","Baixar o Defold bob.jar estável mais recente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы сборки Defold","Запускать тесты на дым для проектов Defold","Скачивать последний стабильный Defold bob.jar"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات بناء Defold","تشغيل اختبارات الدخان للمشاريع Defold","تحميل Defold bob.jar المستقر الأكثر حداثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java 25 or higher","Limited to Defold development environment"],"zh":["需要Java 25或更高版本","仅限Defold开发环境"],"ja":["Java 25以上が必要","Defold開発環境のみ"],"ko":["Java 25 이상 필요","Defold 개발 환경에만限함"],"es":["Requiere Java 25 o superior","Limitado al entorno de desarrollo de Defold"],"fr":["Nécessite Java 25 ou supérieur","Limité à l''environnement de développement Defold"],"de":["Benötigt Java 25 oder höher","Begrenzt auf die Defold-Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Exige Java 25 ou superior","Limitado ao ambiente de desenvolvimento Defold"],"ru":["Требует Java 25 или выше","Ограничен средой разработки Defold"],"ar":["يتطلب Java 25 أو أعلى","محدود بيئة تطوير Defold"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"44ba7253222dd88b05284f9001883ddc93463980a7dd1e4b43fb0cfc6c87dd5b","qualityScore":33}');
