INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('indiesoftby/defold-poki-auds/defold-build', 'defold-build', 'indiesoftby', 'defold-poki-auds', 'community', 'defold-build indiesoftby defold-poki-auds community defold defold-library lua poki remote-config The defold-build skill is a Lua module for automating Defold builds and smoke tests using Poki AUDS. It benefits Defold developers by simplifying the build process. Defold Build Skill 是一个 Lua 模块，使用 Defold 的 http.request 实现 Poki AUDS。它提供了下载最新的 Defold bob.jar 和运行烟雾测试构建的功能 Defold Build Skill は、Defold の http.request を使用して Poki AUDS を実現する Lua モジュールです。最新の Defold bob.jar をダウンロードし、煙霧テストビルドを実行する機能を提供します Defold Build Skill은 Defold의 http.request를 사용하여 Poki AUDS를 구현하는 Lua 모듈입니다. 최신의 Defold bob.jar를 다운로드하고 스모크 테스트 빌드를 실행하는 기능을 제공합니다 Defold-build es un módulo Lua que utiliza Defold''s http.request para Poki AUDS, compatible con Java 25+. Defold-build est un module Lua qui utilise Defold''s http.request pour Poki AUDS, compatible avec Java 25+. Defold-build ist ein Lua-Modul, das Defold''s http.request für Poki AUDS verwendet, kompatibel mit Java 25+. O Defold Build é um módulo Lua para o Poki AUDS, que utiliza o http.request do Defold. Ele baixa a versão estável mais recente do Defold bob.jar e executa testes de fumça Defold Build - это модуль Lua для Poki AUDS, использующий http.request Defold. Он загружает последнюю стабильную версию Defold bob.jar и запускает тесты أداة Defold Build هي وحدة لوح لغة Lua لخزن البيانات المستخدمة من Poki، وتستخدم طلب HTTP من Defold. وهي تتنزيل أحدث إصدار مستقر من Defold bob.jar وتنفذ اختبارات الدخان defold-build setup guide how to use defold-build defold-build alternative defold-build vs manual build defold-build install what is defold-build defold-build automated build defold-build smoke test defold-build lua module Defold Build Skill Lua 模块 Poki AUDS Defold http.request Java 25+ 烟雾测试构建 Defold bob.jar AI 工具 游戏开发 Downloads the latest stable Defold bob.jar Runs smoke test builds using Java 25+ Supports platform-specific scripts for Windows and Linux/macOS Verifies Java version using `java -version` command Executes scripts using PowerShell or Bash defold-build is a Lua module that automates Defold builds and smoke tests using Poki AUDS and Defold''s http.request.');
