INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('pjcau/esp32-emu-turbo/pcb-review', 'pcb-review', 'pjcau', 'esp32-emu-turbo', 'community', 'pcb-review pjcau esp32-emu-turbo community The pcb-review skill provides a comprehensive design review of PCB layouts, analyzing 6 key domains and producing a scored report with suggestions. It benefits developers working with ESP32-S3 for NES and SNES emulation. PCB Review是一种手持式复古游戏机控制台设计审查工具，基于ESP32-S3进行NES和SNES模拟 PCB Reviewは、ESP32-S3を使用したNESとSNESエミュレーションを実現する携帯型レトロゲーム機の設計審查ツールです PCB Review는 ESP32-S3를 기반으로 하는 NES 및 SNES 에뮬레이션을 위한携帯용 레트로 게임 콘솔 설계審查 도구입니다 pcb-review es una herramienta de revisión de diseño de PCB para consolas de juegos retro como NES y SNES, basada en ESP32-S3 pcb-review est un outil de révision de conception de PCB pour les consoles de jeux rétro comme NES et SNES, basé sur ESP32-S3 pcb-review ist ein Werkzeug zur Überprüfung des PCB-Designs für Retro-Spielkonsolen wie NES und SNES, basierend auf ESP32-S3 O pcb-review é uma ferramenta de análise de PCB para emulação de NES e SNES baseada em ESP32-S3. Fornece um relatório detalhado com sugestões de melhoria. ИИ Агент pcb-review - это инструмент комплексного обзора проектирования платы для эмуляции NES и SNES на основе ESP32-S3. Выдаёт подробный отчёт с предложениями по улучшению. pcb-review هو أداة لمراجعة تصميم لوحة الدوائر المطبوعة لتعزيز NES و SNES dựa على ESP32-S3. يقدم تقريرًا مفصلاً مع اقتراحات تحسين how to use pcb-review pcb-review setup guide pcb-review alternative pcb-review vs other design review tools pcb-review install what is pcb-review pcb-review for ESP32-S3 pcb-review for NES and SNES emulation pcb-review automated review pcb-review design optimization PCB设计审查 ESP32-S3 NES模拟 SNES模拟 Python脚本 Power Integrity Decoupling Cap 设计审查工具 携帯式レトロゲーム机 Analyzes 6 key domains, including Power Integrity and Decoupling cap Runs automated reviews using the pcb_review.py script Produces a scored report with actionable improvement suggestions Supports ESP32-S3 for NES and SNES emulation Utilizes Python 3 for script execution Reviews findings based on a scored system (1-10) for each domain pcb-review is a skill that performs a thorough analysis of PCB designs, checking domains like Power Integrity and Decoupling cap, to provide a scored report and improvement suggestions.');
